(282587, 19808, 7131, '<td valign="top">Have you driven over a Ford lately?  Hmm... this doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'Have you driven over a Ford lately?  Hmm... this doesn''t do much for me.', '2003-04-30 01:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(282590, 19951, 2140, '<td valign="top">wow, i did the exact opposite for my submission (blurred background...).<br/>i didn''t think to do it like this. yours looks really good. The exposure was just long enough to show the cars moving but without making it difficult to see what the objects are or messing the lighting.</td>', 'wow, i did the exact opposite for my submission (blurred background...).i didn''t think to do it like this. yours looks really good. The exposure was just long enough to show the cars moving but without making it difficult to see what the objects are or messing the lighting.', '2003-04-30 01:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
