(282622, 20059, 7131, '<td valign="top">Great use of blue!  I''m not the biggest fan of this kind of photography (rather, photo art).  Color can be used wonderfully in an all B&amp;W shot, but there''s no real purpose for the exclusion of color from the rest of the shot.</td>', 'Great use of blue!  I''m not the biggest fan of this kind of photography (rather, photo art).  Color can be used wonderfully in an all B&W shot, but there''s no real purpose for the exclusion of color from the rest of the shot.', '2003-04-30 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
