(282624, 19910, 7131, '<td valign="top">Cool image!  The American flag is a little distracting, as it impedes the view of the gorgeous landscape.  I like the idea here... one mode of transportation inside another one.</td>', 'Cool image!  The American flag is a little distracting, as it impedes the view of the gorgeous landscape.  I like the idea here... one mode of transportation inside another one.', '2003-04-30 01:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
