(282969, 19914, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is my top favourite for the whole challenge. The texture and the light on the water has such a soft feel to it. The composition couldn''t be any better in my opinion and the darkness gives this image a kind of surreal effect. I hope this get''s a ribbon, I''m sure crossing my fingers for you!</td>', 'This is my top favourite for the whole challenge. The texture and the light on the water has such a soft feel to it. The composition couldn''t be any better in my opinion and the darkness gives this image a kind of surreal effect. I hope this get''s a ribbon, I''m sure crossing my fingers for you!', '2003-04-30 07:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(282970, 20017, 6660, '<td valign="top">I feel as though the photographer is more interested in the skyline than the actual subject which is supposed to be transportation, so has put a car into the picture so that it can be submitted.</td>', 'I feel as though the photographer is more interested in the skyline than the actual subject which is supposed to be transportation, so has put a car into the picture so that it can be submitted.', '2003-04-30 07:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(282972, 19740, 6660, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture do to the purple light cast onto the chrome, which helps to give it that WoW factor.</td>', 'I really like this picture do to the purple light cast onto the chrome, which helps to give it that WoW factor.', '2003-04-30 07:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(282974, 19632, 6660, '<td valign="top">I feel that this pictures unusual composition helps to make it more interesting. Nice idea.</td>', 'I feel that this pictures unusual composition helps to make it more interesting. Nice idea.', '2003-04-30 07:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(282975, 19589, 8274, '<td valign="top">It would be easy to dismiss this work, but there is much to explore. I like the girl on the phone, is she bored?</td>', 'It would be easy to dismiss this work, but there is much to explore. I like the girl on the phone, is she bored?', '2003-04-30 07:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(282977, 19961, 6660, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and picture, and understand that waterways are transportation but definitely feel that this picture could have benefited from a boat to give a better impression of transport. Also feel that cropping out the town would focus more attention on the waterway and lock.</td>', 'Nice idea and picture, and understand that waterways are transportation but definitely feel that this picture could have benefited from a boat to give a better impression of transport. Also feel that cropping out the town would focus more attention on the waterway and lock.', '2003-04-30 07:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(282980, 19903, 6660, '<td valign="top">I like this cause the photographer has go nice and close in enabling us to see the reflections in the car and the superb paintwork job.</td>', 'I like this cause the photographer has go nice and close in enabling us to see the reflections in the car and the superb paintwork job.', '2003-04-30 07:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(282983, 19502, 6660, '<td valign="top">Like the starburst effect, and the general composition, but a bit closer in might have helped, including cropping a bit off the top (which I feel is not really giving anything to the picture, and helps one focus more on the subject).</td>', 'Like the starburst effect, and the general composition, but a bit closer in might have helped, including cropping a bit off the top (which I feel is not really giving anything to the picture, and helps one focus more on the subject).', '2003-04-30 07:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(282988, 19848, 6660, '<td valign="top">Really like this shot except for the sun shining through the trays, which I fell mars the balance of the foto. Also like the angle and the lense that was used on this shot.</td>', 'Really like this shot except for the sun shining through the trays, which I fell mars the balance of the foto. Also like the angle and the lense that was used on this shot.', '2003-04-30 07:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(282991, 20045, 5728, '<td valign="top">The star effects off those lights are what really turns this image from an average night highway photo into an outstanding photo. You got your shutter speed in exactly right there.</td>', 'The star effects off those lights are what really turns this image from an average night highway photo into an outstanding photo. You got your shutter speed in exactly right there.', '2003-04-30 08:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(282992, 19489, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now that was a good idea for a transportation photo! So simple but with so much inpact, and it works very well in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Now that was a good idea for a transportation photo! So simple but with so much inpact, and it works very well in B&W.', '2003-04-30 08:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
