(283003, 20008, 6660, '<td valign="top">I think this shows transportation on two different levels very nicely. Well chosen subject. Pity about the signs. Might be slightly better if you crop off the top so that none of the signs show or even just to the top of the bottom TV/Sign, even though it does lose a lot of the train.</td>', 'I think this shows transportation on two different levels very nicely. Well chosen subject. Pity about the signs. Might be slightly better if you crop off the top so that none of the signs show or even just to the top of the bottom TV/Sign, even though it does lose a lot of the train.', '2003-04-30 08:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
