(283031, 19460, 3669, '<td valign="top">I like the narrow DOF.  Gives it a tunnel feel and is appropriate for this shot.  The colors are actually nice...very busy.  Definately meets challenge.</td>', 'I like the narrow DOF.  Gives it a tunnel feel and is appropriate for this shot.  The colors are actually nice...very busy.  Definately meets challenge.', '2003-04-30 09:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(283033, 20004, 3669, '<td valign="top">I really like the take on the challenge and the angle at which you took this shot.  I''m not sure that the forgotten toy adds anything to the subject.  I would prefer that it had been left out.  Beside that, the bike or trike is nicely framed in the picture, focus is good, and makes for a nice B&amp;W.  The way the handle bars are framed in the picture, add nice dimension.  Good shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like the take on the challenge and the angle at which you took this shot.  I''m not sure that the forgotten toy adds anything to the subject.  I would prefer that it had been left out.  Beside that, the bike or trike is nicely framed in the picture, focus is good, and makes for a nice B&W.  The way the handle bars are framed in the picture, add nice dimension.  Good shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-04-30 09:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(283035, 19713, 2634, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe someone used MY title...great idea!<br/>On the technical side-a little too light on the whites and I would like to have seen this with a much shorter DOF.</td>', 'I can''t believe someone used MY title...great idea!On the technical side-a little too light on the whites and I would like to have seen this with a much shorter DOF.', '2003-04-30 09:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
