(283161, 19589, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the subtleness of your center of attention.  Red is a distracting color.  No matter how imposing your center of attention is the viewer will always be drawn to the red area.  A different vantage point might have allowed you to crop out the red in the background.</td>', 'I like the subtleness of your center of attention.  Red is a distracting color.  No matter how imposing your center of attention is the viewer will always be drawn to the red area.  A different vantage point might have allowed you to crop out the red in the background.', '2003-04-30 10:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
