(283314, 19588, 6870, '<td valign="top">I really like how the cables and wires and struts can be seen here so clearly. Nice choice to use the rule of thirds for this, adding a sense that the plane has space to go on the right. I like the clouds, too, though I wish there were just a little more contrast in them (personal taste on my part).</td>', 'I really like how the cables and wires and struts can be seen here so clearly. Nice choice to use the rule of thirds for this, adding a sense that the plane has space to go on the right. I like the clouds, too, though I wish there were just a little more contrast in them (personal taste on my part).', '2003-04-30 12:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
