(283317, 19667, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice use of panning here! Very nice work. I think if the ambulance were in the right half of the frame, breaking the normal rules for this sort of thing, it would add to its sense of urgency. Just something to try. Good job.</td>', 'Nice use of panning here! Very nice work. I think if the ambulance were in the right half of the frame, breaking the normal rules for this sort of thing, it would add to its sense of urgency. Just something to try. Good job.', '2003-04-30 12:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
