(283582, 19923, 4517, '<td valign="top">Oh this must be the Sony Mavica FD-73 camera. So you must be one of the class of students that have a unique way of leaving identical comments for every photo. I don`t care for that very much but this photo is probaly the best one yet with this rather limited camera.<br/>Good luck.  8</td>', 'Oh this must be the Sony Mavica FD-73 camera. So you must be one of the class of students that have a unique way of leaving identical comments for every photo. I don`t care for that very much but this photo is probaly the best one yet with this rather limited camera.Good luck.  8', '2003-04-30 14:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(283585, 19912, 4517, '<td valign="top">Not a bad pic but border on right not needed.</td>', 'Not a bad pic but border on right not needed.', '2003-04-30 14:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(283590, 19783, 7628, '<td valign="top">This image is ironic - 2 forms of transportation, neither sleek, fast or effective (as might be a US sterotype of transportion).  These tell a story (its not the destination, but the journey?).  I like the compositio of the road curving out of sight, the rustled rail framing the top, and all that lush green that looks like it is about to swallow up the road.  Looks like the lighting was challenging.  It would have been nice if more light had come from behind you, and not all that glare from behond the bridge.</td>', 'This image is ironic - 2 forms of transportation, neither sleek, fast or effective (as might be a US sterotype of transportion).  These tell a story (its not the destination, but the journey?).  I like the compositio of the road curving out of sight, the rustled rail framing the top, and all that lush green that looks like it is about to swallow up the road.  Looks like the lighting was challenging.  It would have been nice if more light had come from behind you, and not all that glare from behond the bridge.', '2003-04-30 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(283592, 19966, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like th mottled green of the foliage in the background, and how that contrasts with the shiny black of the boat.  I also like the red boat contrasting in the background, but the stuff on the left in the back is distracting.  Perhaps you could have gotten a more pleasing composition had you moved left and turned right a little?  I don''t know if that was possile.  I like the ropes leading up to the red knob - draws your eyes into the photo.</td>', 'I like th mottled green of the foliage in the background, and how that contrasts with the shiny black of the boat.  I also like the red boat contrasting in the background, but the stuff on the left in the back is distracting.  Perhaps you could have gotten a more pleasing composition had you moved left and turned right a little?  I don''t know if that was possile.  I like the ropes leading up to the red knob - draws your eyes into the photo.', '2003-04-30 14:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(283593, 19915, 4517, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, it`s got great focus, colour and depth of field. I like the way the bike looks like it`s just been thrown against the fence. My only niggle is the wheel chopped of the bottom. 9</td>', 'I like this a lot, it`s got great focus, colour and depth of field. I like the way the bike looks like it`s just been thrown against the fence. My only niggle is the wheel chopped of the bottom. 9', '2003-04-30 14:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(283594, 19815, 7628, '<td valign="top">Comparative transportation - cute.  Wouold be better with a more even background - golf course grass, moss, or even concrete?  Human foot is a little blue, could have more definition with better lighting.</td>', 'Comparative transportation - cute.  Wouold be better with a more even background - golf course grass, moss, or even concrete?  Human foot is a little blue, could have more definition with better lighting.', '2003-04-30 14:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
