(283664, 19949, 3028, '<td valign="top">Your image is only 37kb and some jpeg compression is showing. You should do less compressing when you enter the picture because it can be up to 150kb in size. Also you shot could use some post-production, with brightness, levels and contrast set a lot higher. Good luck in the future! - 6</td>', 'Your image is only 37kb and some jpeg compression is showing. You should do less compressing when you enter the picture because it can be up to 150kb in size. Also you shot could use some post-production, with brightness, levels and contrast set a lot higher. Good luck in the future! - 6', '2003-04-30 15:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
