(283695, 19933, 4517, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. If you had taken off the outside black part of the border i think you would score higher. 8</td>', 'Excellent shot. If you had taken off the outside black part of the border i think you would score higher. 8', '2003-04-30 15:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(283697, 19986, 7730, '<td valign="top">Interesting Shot</td>', 'Interesting Shot', '2003-04-30 15:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(283699, 19428, 4517, '<td valign="top">Maybe some fill in flash on the truck would have helped.</td>', 'Maybe some fill in flash on the truck would have helped.', '2003-04-30 15:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(283700, 19503, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the rain splatters behind the car and the black against the pebble paving.  Your BMW hubcap should be more central to the composition (see rule of thirds) Crop on the left to work better with the tail light (right now the cut is at an odd angle with the light)</td>', 'I like the rain splatters behind the car and the black against the pebble paving.  Your BMW hubcap should be more central to the composition (see rule of thirds) Crop on the left to work better with the tail light (right now the cut is at an odd angle with the light)', '2003-04-30 15:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(283702, 19267, 6663, '<td valign="top">This picture has a lovely minimalist feel. And the border, despite being thicker than I would normally like, is very effective with the clean lines of the photo. Very original. A winner.</td>', 'This picture has a lovely minimalist feel. And the border, despite being thicker than I would normally like, is very effective with the clean lines of the photo. Very original. A winner.', '2003-04-30 15:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(283704, 19903, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice color, composition (maybe give a little more room at the front of the car)  There are some weird artifacts from some processing -sharpenning?</td>', 'Nice color, composition (maybe give a little more room at the front of the car)  There are some weird artifacts from some processing -sharpenning?', '2003-04-30 15:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(283705, 19586, 6663, '<td valign="top">I see the idea but I feel it''s a little outside the theme. I also think some people are going to find this in bad taste. You''ll probably still do better than me this week though :)</td>', 'I see the idea but I feel it''s a little outside the theme. I also think some people are going to find this in bad taste. You''ll probably still do better than me this week though :)', '2003-04-30 15:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(283707, 19884, 6663, '<td valign="top">This is extremely similar to Weather challenge - ''Clouds are Closer Than They Appear''. Either the same author...or a copycat??<br/> <br/>Regardless, I really like this style, although I don''t feel this is as effective as I found the aforementioned. I''ll still give it a 7.</td>', 'This is extremely similar to Weather challenge - ''Clouds are Closer Than They Appear''. Either the same author...or a copycat?? Regardless, I really like this style, although I don''t feel this is as effective as I found the aforementioned. I''ll still give it a 7.', '2003-04-30 15:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(283709, 19588, 6008, '<td valign="top">I admit to having a soft spot for b&amp;w/sepia toned photographs, but coupled with the old plane makes this really shine. The broody clouds also add a nice dramatic effect. I like the motion on the tail too.</td>', 'I admit to having a soft spot for b&w/sepia toned photographs, but coupled with the old plane makes this really shine. The broody clouds also add a nice dramatic effect. I like the motion on the tail too.', '2003-04-30 15:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(283710, 19494, 7628, '<td valign="top">Cluttered and random composition - loose other wing in forground or include more of that plane.  Too much white sky.  I like the idea of comparison between such a big plane and small one - maybe crouching down in front of a small plane with that plane sharp and clear, whiel using small depth of field to have a fuzzy but recognizable 747 in the background.  Both planes filling the frame.</td>', 'Cluttered and random composition - loose other wing in forground or include more of that plane.  Too much white sky.  I like the idea of comparison between such a big plane and small one - maybe crouching down in front of a small plane with that plane sharp and clear, whiel using small depth of field to have a fuzzy but recognizable 747 in the background.  Both planes filling the frame.', '2003-04-30 15:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(283711, 19997, 6663, '<td valign="top">This pic has a lovely serenity to it - you''ve also caught a beautiful sky very well. Congratulations, this is a fine pic.</td>', 'This pic has a lovely serenity to it - you''ve also caught a beautiful sky very well. Congratulations, this is a fine pic.', '2003-04-30 15:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(283712, 19893, 3028, '<td valign="top">Strange color choice... - 5</td>', 'Strange color choice... - 5', '2003-04-30 15:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(283714, 19642, 7730, '<td valign="top">Looks a little over compressed.</td>', 'Looks a little over compressed.', '2003-04-30 15:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(283715, 19868, 7800, '<td valign="top">The image is a bit too centered to me. I would have liked it left aligned with room for the boat to move across the water.</td>', 'The image is a bit too centered to me. I would have liked it left aligned with room for the boat to move across the water.', '2003-04-30 15:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(283716, 20024, 7628, '<td valign="top">great to get down on foot level.  I like how the composition anticipates the subject walking into the frame - makes us notice the feet even though we can''t see much of them.  The tiny house, the path curving left all add to the "story"  Nice texture, nice negative space</td>', 'great to get down on foot level.  I like how the composition anticipates the subject walking into the frame - makes us notice the feet even though we can''t see much of them.  The tiny house, the path curving left all add to the "story"  Nice texture, nice negative space', '2003-04-30 15:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(283717, 19954, 7800, '<td valign="top">Nice. i like the foreground, looking through the willows to the boat and then to the water. Good job.</td>', 'Nice. i like the foreground, looking through the willows to the boat and then to the water. Good job.', '2003-04-30 15:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(283718, 19971, 6663, '<td valign="top">If this is your car, shame on you for boasting...although it is quite nice ;). And is that a personalised plate? Hell yeah.</td>', 'If this is your car, shame on you for boasting...although it is quite nice ;). And is that a personalised plate? Hell yeah.', '2003-04-30 15:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(283719, 19439, 6008, '<td valign="top">The perspective is great, and the tone compliments the slow-paced transportation nicely. The only real negative thing is the driftwood, trash or whatever it is beside the pillar in the lower left - it''s a little distracting. A higher crop would have eliminated that, but would also take away from the great perspective depth of the bridge. Sometimes you just have to work with what you got. Wonderful image either way!</td>', 'The perspective is great, and the tone compliments the slow-paced transportation nicely. The only real negative thing is the driftwood, trash or whatever it is beside the pillar in the lower left - it''s a little distracting. A higher crop would have eliminated that, but would also take away from the great perspective depth of the bridge. Sometimes you just have to work with what you got. Wonderful image either way!', '2003-04-30 15:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(283721, 19866, 7628, '<td valign="top">Find a way to point your camera that makes us see the horse as more than just a horse - what is it you want to say about the horse in general or this horse inspecific?  Strong?  Big?  get down below the horseand point the camera up to it.  Tired, Hot?  Put that sleepy eye at a central part of the composition.  A great way to explore senic trails?  Put that horse in a spot with a senic background.  Fun to ride?  Put a happy, energetic rider on him.</td>', 'Find a way to point your camera that makes us see the horse as more than just a horse - what is it you want to say about the horse in general or this horse inspecific?  Strong?  Big?  get down below the horseand point the camera up to it.  Tired, Hot?  Put that sleepy eye at a central part of the composition.  A great way to explore senic trails?  Put that horse in a spot with a senic background.  Fun to ride?  Put a happy, energetic rider on him.', '2003-04-30 15:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(283722, 19992, 7628, '<td valign="top">lol - nice pun.  Did you set it up or find it that way?</td>', 'lol - nice pun.  Did you set it up or find it that way?', '2003-04-30 15:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(283723, 19642, 6663, '<td valign="top">This is a very good shot considering it''s obviously taken through a plane window - well done! It''s also a good idea - clouds look very different (and more beautiful) when viewd from this height. I think I may be missing something in the title  - ''Scarlets clouds''? Never mind, lovely photo.</td>', 'This is a very good shot considering it''s obviously taken through a plane window - well done! It''s also a good idea - clouds look very different (and more beautiful) when viewd from this height. I think I may be missing something in the title  - ''Scarlets clouds''? Never mind, lovely photo.', '2003-04-30 15:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(283725, 19646, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the line of lights into the vanishing point.</td>', 'I like the line of lights into the vanishing point.', '2003-04-30 15:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(283727, 19967, 7628, '<td valign="top">very pretty, surreal.  Wish there wer no fences to take away from the glowing horse.  Like the yellow flora in the forground.</td>', 'very pretty, surreal.  Wish there wer no fences to take away from the glowing horse.  Like the yellow flora in the forground.', '2003-04-30 15:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(283729, 19883, 6663, '<td valign="top">This is an effective shot, but I have only one minor gripe and that is that I feel the exposure is too long - instead of flashes from the lights, you''ve created complete lines across the screen. This doesn''t work quite as well for me - although it does relate well to the title - the superhighway being fast as light. <br/> <br/>Oh, I don''t know, I''m contradicting myself now :)</td>', 'This is an effective shot, but I have only one minor gripe and that is that I feel the exposure is too long - instead of flashes from the lights, you''ve created complete lines across the screen. This doesn''t work quite as well for me - although it does relate well to the title - the superhighway being fast as light.  Oh, I don''t know, I''m contradicting myself now :)', '2003-04-30 16:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(283731, 19995, 6008, '<td valign="top">I think b&amp;w was a great choice for the image. This way the probably mash of colors was eliminated to concentrate on the duality of paces depicted - the rush of the busy commuter and the stillness of the train and those within, still waiting to reach their destination. The reverse motion of having the pedestrians (as it were) moving and the transportation motionless is quite interesting. A stimulating image!</td>', 'I think b&w was a great choice for the image. This way the probably mash of colors was eliminated to concentrate on the duality of paces depicted - the rush of the busy commuter and the stillness of the train and those within, still waiting to reach their destination. The reverse motion of having the pedestrians (as it were) moving and the transportation motionless is quite interesting. A stimulating image!', '2003-04-30 16:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(283732, 19972, 6663, '<td valign="top">That pun is awful. You should be punished :)</td>', 'That pun is awful. You should be punished :)', '2003-04-30 16:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(283734, 19720, 6663, '<td valign="top">Las Vegas - the epitome of restrained class :)</td>', 'Las Vegas - the epitome of restrained class :)', '2003-04-30 16:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(283735, 20021, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I like how you can see the wood grain in the shadow.  The photo is as warm and well worn looking as the boots. 9</td>', 'Nice!  I like how you can see the wood grain in the shadow.  The photo is as warm and well worn looking as the boots. 9', '2003-04-30 16:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(283737, 19503, 6663, '<td valign="top">3 Beemers so far and count - and a Benz. People just seem to want to show off their flashy motors... (sorry, I''m just a bit jealous) :)<br/> <br/>I like the way you''ve caught the drops coming off the tyres here though. Gives the shot great movement.</td>', '3 Beemers so far and count - and a Benz. People just seem to want to show off their flashy motors... (sorry, I''m just a bit jealous) :) I like the way you''ve caught the drops coming off the tyres here though. Gives the shot great movement.', '2003-04-30 16:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(283739, 19933, 6663, '<td valign="top">I think the fact that the border is black and this thick stifles the pic a little here.</td>', 'I think the fact that the border is black and this thick stifles the pic a little here.', '2003-04-30 16:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(283745, 19783, 4517, '<td valign="top">seems a little out of focus but colours are good</td>', 'seems a little out of focus but colours are good', '2003-04-30 16:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(283746, 19777, 6663, '<td valign="top">Love the way you''ve caught a splash of vibrant red amongst all the blue here - very nice shot indeed.</td>', 'Love the way you''ve caught a splash of vibrant red amongst all the blue here - very nice shot indeed.', '2003-04-30 16:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(283747, 19975, 6008, '<td valign="top">The choice of sepia goes well with the subject, suggesting a bygone age. The slant works well, and in this case, at least to me, makes it a recognisable San Francisco (or I hope!) The small hints of cloud also add some depth, although I''m not sure about the tree tops on the left.</td>', 'The choice of sepia goes well with the subject, suggesting a bygone age. The slant works well, and in this case, at least to me, makes it a recognisable San Francisco (or I hope!) The small hints of cloud also add some depth, although I''m not sure about the tree tops on the left.', '2003-04-30 16:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(283748, 20011, 6663, '<td valign="top">Like the way you''ve shot through the web to convey the age - smart.</td>', 'Like the way you''ve shot through the web to convey the age - smart.', '2003-04-30 16:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(283755, 19542, 6663, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea - the contrast of the colours is about all my eyes can take! Very nice.</td>', 'Very clever idea - the contrast of the colours is about all my eyes can take! Very nice.', '2003-04-30 16:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(283756, 19421, 4517, '<td valign="top">I love night shots and especially when there this good. Good depth of field and stopped just at the right moment. 10</td>', 'I love night shots and especially when there this good. Good depth of field and stopped just at the right moment. 10', '2003-04-30 16:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(283761, 19839, 6663, '<td valign="top">Oooh - I love TT''s. You lucky ol'' thing, you.<br/> <br/>In all seriousness, I really like this too - you''ve picked a great POV to shoot from, made the car look really imposing. I like the title, too.<br/> <br/>So that''s three thumbs up, then!</td>', 'Oooh - I love TT''s. You lucky ol'' thing, you. In all seriousness, I really like this too - you''ve picked a great POV to shoot from, made the car look really imposing. I like the title, too. So that''s three thumbs up, then!', '2003-04-30 16:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(283763, 19898, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - 3 levels of gray, with a tiny corner of green!  And walking right down the line are a very interesting pair of shoes.  Wish the shoes were completely sharp.</td>', 'Nice composition - 3 levels of gray, with a tiny corner of green!  And walking right down the line are a very interesting pair of shoes.  Wish the shoes were completely sharp.', '2003-04-30 16:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(283766, 19968, 6663, '<td valign="top">You drive a BM, yes? (I''ve not got one :( but I recognise those dials)<br/> <br/>Original take on the car theme. The dials give a pleasing symmetry to the shot (but I guess that''s partly hats off to those wonderful German engineers eh? ;)</td>', 'You drive a BM, yes? (I''ve not got one :( but I recognise those dials) Original take on the car theme. The dials give a pleasing symmetry to the shot (but I guess that''s partly hats off to those wonderful German engineers eh? ;)', '2003-04-30 16:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(283768, 19591, 3607, '<td valign="top">this could also be called ''fuel'' ;-)  i like the panning effect, but find the background distracting (although i know there wasn''t much you could do about it).</td>', 'this could also be called ''fuel'' ;-)  i like the panning effect, but find the background distracting (although i know there wasn''t much you could do about it).', '2003-04-30 16:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
