(284398, 19914, 5767, '<td valign="top">Great colors and composition.  Top marks for having an interesting image with good exposure and not too much contrast.</td>', 'Great colors and composition.  Top marks for having an interesting image with good exposure and not too much contrast.', '2003-05-01 01:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(284399, 19902, 5767, '<td valign="top">Won''t be going anywhere anytime soon.  Good colors in the rust.</td>', 'Won''t be going anywhere anytime soon.  Good colors in the rust.', '2003-05-01 01:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(284400, 19699, 2923, '<td valign="top">Shoudln''t have to explain "view while seated"</td>', 'Shoudln''t have to explain "view while seated"', '2003-05-01 01:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(284402, 19975, 2923, '<td valign="top">nice sepia 7</td>', 'nice sepia 7', '2003-05-01 01:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(284404, 19967, 2923, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus 9</td>', 'Nice soft focus 9', '2003-05-01 01:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(284405, 19798, 5767, '<td valign="top">Nice grain and perspective. The abstractness of this adds to the "allure" of what you''ve achieved here.  It would have been nice to have the "star" a bit shinier, but that is a small criticism.  Overall, high marks for this one.</td>', 'Nice grain and perspective. The abstractness of this adds to the "allure" of what you''ve achieved here.  It would have been nice to have the "star" a bit shinier, but that is a small criticism.  Overall, high marks for this one.', '2003-05-01 01:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(284406, 20040, 2586, '<td valign="top">Special lens, filter? Good lighting. Like all the lines in this image. Arresting. 9 Journey</td>', 'Special lens, filter? Good lighting. Like all the lines in this image. Arresting. 9 Journey', '2003-05-01 01:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(284407, 19733, 5767, '<td valign="top">Nice entry.  The colors and exposure are well done.  The perspective and composition are also nicely executed.</td>', 'Nice entry.  The colors and exposure are well done.  The perspective and composition are also nicely executed.', '2003-05-01 01:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(284408, 19699, 5767, '<td valign="top">Great use of B&amp;W - it really adds to this image.  Your perspective and clarity throughout is very well done.</td>', 'Great use of B&W - it really adds to this image.  Your perspective and clarity throughout is very well done.', '2003-05-01 02:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(284411, 19370, 5767, '<td valign="top">One of the defining characteristics of Ferrari''s is their distinctive colors.  To have washed that out in a B&amp;W I think removes much of the "car''s" uniqueness.  The horse remains, though.  Nice reflection in the side mirror.</td>', 'One of the defining characteristics of Ferrari''s is their distinctive colors.  To have washed that out in a B&W I think removes much of the "car''s" uniqueness.  The horse remains, though.  Nice reflection in the side mirror.', '2003-05-01 02:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(284413, 19714, 2586, '<td valign="top">Red bull again? Cool  action shot. Tired of too many takes on the ''got milk'' theme. 9 Journey</td>', 'Red bull again? Cool  action shot. Tired of too many takes on the ''got milk'' theme. 9 Journey', '2003-05-01 02:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(284414, 19701, 5767, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  The light in the background adds a lot to this.  To have made a trans-am look interesting gives you added points !</td>', 'Great composition.  The light in the background adds a lot to this.  To have made a trans-am look interesting gives you added points !', '2003-05-01 02:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(284416, 20045, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Nice mood. Great colors.  8 Journey</td>', 'Nice shot. Nice mood. Great colors.  8 Journey', '2003-05-01 02:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(284417, 20030, 5767, '<td valign="top">Literally!  I like the title.  Nice old form of transportation.</td>', 'Literally!  I like the title.  Nice old form of transportation.', '2003-05-01 02:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(284420, 20035, 5767, '<td valign="top">Now here is a use of B&amp;W on a brightly colored (or shiny, for those black ones) that works VERY well.  Good composition, contrast and exposure.</td>', 'Now here is a use of B&W on a brightly colored (or shiny, for those black ones) that works VERY well.  Good composition, contrast and exposure.', '2003-05-01 02:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(284421, 20024, 5767, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and composition.</td>', 'Great perspective and composition.', '2003-05-01 02:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(284423, 19735, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape. Did you have any control over that red vw bus? If not, you were very lucky because it''s a critical element (color particularly and challenge too) in this picture. Like the colors.  Trees seem a little oversharpened and they read as ''busy'' somewhat which unfortunately mars slightly the nice, quiet feel of the picture. Just wondering, do i ''know'' you? 8 Journey</td>', 'Nice landscape. Did you have any control over that red vw bus? If not, you were very lucky because it''s a critical element (color particularly and challenge too) in this picture. Like the colors.  Trees seem a little oversharpened and they read as ''busy'' somewhat which unfortunately mars slightly the nice, quiet feel of the picture. Just wondering, do i ''know'' you? 8 Journey', '2003-05-01 02:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(284426, 19991, 5767, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the DC metro.  Composition, use of color and motion are excellent.</td>', 'Great capture of the DC metro.  Composition, use of color and motion are excellent.', '2003-05-01 02:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(284427, 20028, 5767, '<td valign="top">Good use of color in this.  The curve it creates really draws me into this.</td>', 'Good use of color in this.  The curve it creates really draws me into this.', '2003-05-01 02:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(284429, 19907, 5767, '<td valign="top">Great clarity, contrast and use of the model train.  Excellent.</td>', 'Great clarity, contrast and use of the model train.  Excellent.', '2003-05-01 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(284431, 19885, 5767, '<td valign="top">You''ve done an excellent job with this.  Nice soft feel to this and excellent perspective.</td>', 'You''ve done an excellent job with this.  Nice soft feel to this and excellent perspective.', '2003-05-01 02:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(284436, 19686, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice car, nice colors, nice picture. Personally, would have preferred a bit more dof on the trees since the ''red'' is so strong and doesn''t want anything more to compete for attention. 8 Journey</td>', 'Nice car, nice colors, nice picture. Personally, would have preferred a bit more dof on the trees since the ''red'' is so strong and doesn''t want anything more to compete for attention. 8 Journey', '2003-05-01 02:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(284447, 19886, 6892, '<td valign="top">Very interesting studio shot. Are you a collector of models?</td>', 'Very interesting studio shot. Are you a collector of models?', '2003-05-01 02:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(284448, 19366, 7528, '<td valign="top">Nice composition</td>', 'Nice composition', '2003-05-01 03:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(284449, 19732, 7528, '<td valign="top">Angle and the composition need improvement.. sorry.<br/></td>', 'Angle and the composition need improvement.. sorry.', '2003-05-01 03:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(284452, 19898, 7528, '<td valign="top">I like this photo but i don''t think it works in color.. perhaps bw will help?</td>', 'I like this photo but i don''t think it works in color.. perhaps bw will help?', '2003-05-01 03:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
