(284899, 20056, 7778, '<td valign="top">I quite like this shot, the b/w choice and placement/framing. I also think, it meets the topic very well in a humourous way. What I would wish for is a lil greater sharpness.</td>', 'I quite like this shot, the b/w choice and placement/framing. I also think, it meets the topic very well in a humourous way. What I would wish for is a lil greater sharpness.', '2003-05-01 14:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(284901, 19644, 7350, '<td valign="top">I see you in the shot in a few places.  That''s why I didn''t submit my motorcycle shot.  Anyway, I''ll ignore that and give you an 8.</td>', 'I see you in the shot in a few places.  That''s why I didn''t submit my motorcycle shot.  Anyway, I''ll ignore that and give you an 8.', '2003-05-01 14:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(284902, 20023, 7607, '<td valign="top">Nice use of background</td>', 'Nice use of background', '2003-05-01 14:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(284905, 19967, 2677, '<td valign="top">A touch too red on my monitor, but I like the glowing soft-focus in this instance.  Normally I think it''s played out.</td>', 'A touch too red on my monitor, but I like the glowing soft-focus in this instance.  Normally I think it''s played out.', '2003-05-01 14:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(284907, 19953, 2586, '<td valign="top">A heck of an action shot. Feel so close to this action that i''m afraid he''s just about to fall into my lap. Hence, the title is most appropriate :) The composition gives this shot a nice balance. Also ''feel'' the tranquillity of this activity - helped much by all that blue sky below the jumper.  Normally, sports shots don''t have that much appeal to me. This shot though does because you managed to turn this into a representation of a modern-day Icarus.  It''s quite a statement about how far the human race has come.  Find this picture very artistic.  10 Journey</td>', 'A heck of an action shot. Feel so close to this action that i''m afraid he''s just about to fall into my lap. Hence, the title is most appropriate :) The composition gives this shot a nice balance. Also ''feel'' the tranquillity of this activity - helped much by all that blue sky below the jumper.  Normally, sports shots don''t have that much appeal to me. This shot though does because you managed to turn this into a representation of a modern-day Icarus.  It''s quite a statement about how far the human race has come.  Find this picture very artistic.  10 Journey', '2003-05-01 14:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(284908, 19818, 2677, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I wish it were wider, or the camera further away.  I want to see some more detail of the front of the car or somthing.  Maybe the edges of the headlights?  I guess I''m saying it''s maybe too tight of a crop.  Good shot though.  Nice ride!</td>', 'Nice, but I wish it were wider, or the camera further away.  I want to see some more detail of the front of the car or somthing.  Maybe the edges of the headlights?  I guess I''m saying it''s maybe too tight of a crop.  Good shot though.  Nice ride!', '2003-05-01 14:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(284911, 19847, 2677, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation, but I bet your score will suffer from people that think it doesn''t fit.  I''m still on the fence.  Good shot of the studio though.</td>', 'Nice interpretation, but I bet your score will suffer from people that think it doesn''t fit.  I''m still on the fence.  Good shot of the studio though.', '2003-05-01 14:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(284912, 19667, 2677, '<td valign="top">Great pan, but I think the USM was applied too liberily.  A little loss of detail would''ve been okay.7</td>', 'Great pan, but I think the USM was applied too liberily.  A little loss of detail would''ve been okay.7', '2003-05-01 14:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(284914, 19591, 7607, '<td valign="top">Nice action here. Congrats</td>', 'Nice action here. Congrats', '2003-05-01 14:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(284915, 19650, 2677, '<td valign="top">So when does the restoration project begin? ;)</td>', 'So when does the restoration project begin? ;)', '2003-05-01 14:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(284916, 19868, 2677, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition!8</td>', 'Excellent composition!8', '2003-05-01 14:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(284917, 19973, 7778, '<td valign="top">It''s topical, not very topical, but topical. <br/> <br/>Focus and sharpness are good, saturation richer than appeals to ''me'', although grass isn''t easy get just right. <br/> <br/>The subject(s) looks a bit too arranged perhaps, with clean cloves so neatly folded on upright handle. Blossoms and gloves interfere a little. The choice of subject is undoubtedly ''clichee''. It does, IMO, make for a ''pleasant'' postcard.</td>', 'It''s topical, not very topical, but topical.  Focus and sharpness are good, saturation richer than appeals to ''me'', although grass isn''t easy get just right.  The subject(s) looks a bit too arranged perhaps, with clean cloves so neatly folded on upright handle. Blossoms and gloves interfere a little. The choice of subject is undoubtedly ''clichee''. It does, IMO, make for a ''pleasant'' postcard.', '2003-05-01 14:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(284919, 19740, 2677, '<td valign="top">I don;t know why but I LOVE the purple reflection!  What is that making the color?</td>', 'I don;t know why but I LOVE the purple reflection!  What is that making the color?', '2003-05-01 14:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(284921, 20028, 2677, '<td valign="top">Is that a jump further down the road(jk)?!  That would be sweeet...  I loke the selective color</td>', 'Is that a jump further down the road(jk)?!  That would be sweeet...  I loke the selective color', '2003-05-01 14:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(284926, 19821, 7474, '<td valign="top">beautiful exposure and<br/>interesting blue color tones :)<br/>well done</td>', 'beautiful exposure andinteresting blue color tones :)well done', '2003-05-01 14:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(284929, 19849, 7778, '<td valign="top">A perfect shot, technically. Could it be too slick for an eye barraged with slick ''commercial'' imagery?</td>', 'A perfect shot, technically. Could it be too slick for an eye barraged with slick ''commercial'' imagery?', '2003-05-01 14:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(284935, 19786, 7778, '<td valign="top">Ah, a photographer who holds his sense of aethestics higher than popularity. I award extra points for this. Lovely monochrome!</td>', 'Ah, a photographer who holds his sense of aethestics higher than popularity. I award extra points for this. Lovely monochrome!', '2003-05-01 14:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
