(284949, 20008, 2109, '<td valign="top">This is really good ... the desaturation is almost perfect ... the red looks nice.  Not sure what the big white objects are ... TV screens perhaps?  Looks almost impossible to have kept those from being overexposed given the exposure time it appears you used.  Nice job... one of my favs this week</td>', 'This is really good ... the desaturation is almost perfect ... the red looks nice.  Not sure what the big white objects are ... TV screens perhaps?  Looks almost impossible to have kept those from being overexposed given the exposure time it appears you used.  Nice job... one of my favs this week', '2003-05-01 14:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
