(284963, 19956, 2109, '<td valign="top">This photo is pretty good, but it would be absolutely spectacular if you were able to give it a longer exposure allowing the streaks of light from the bus completely pass through the entire shot.  Would be kinda hard to pull off if the buss were to stop or the guy in the shot were to move!  Nice job though</td>', 'This photo is pretty good, but it would be absolutely spectacular if you were able to give it a longer exposure allowing the streaks of light from the bus completely pass through the entire shot.  Would be kinda hard to pull off if the buss were to stop or the guy in the shot were to move!  Nice job though', '2003-05-01 14:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
