(284984, 19555, 6660, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF of focus that has been used, and the way basic colours have been used. It does not receive a higher vote from me, cause it just does not have that wow factor (wish I could tell you what it was).</td>', 'I like the DOF of focus that has been used, and the way basic colours have been used. It does not receive a higher vote from me, cause it just does not have that wow factor (wish I could tell you what it was).', '2003-05-01 14:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
