(285048, 19433, 7778, '<td valign="top">The riders'' position could be improved, the stir-up leathers ought to be lengthened. First rider''s toe is pointing outward. Altogether, I think, the RCMP needs better dressage training.<br/> <br/>:-)</td>', 'The riders'' position could be improved, the stir-up leathers ought to be lengthened. First rider''s toe is pointing outward. Altogether, I think, the RCMP needs better dressage training. :-)', '2003-05-01 15:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(285049, 19676, 6660, '<td valign="top">Nice boarder, good shot, but feel the composition could have been improved if the chain was on the first or last cog, thus giving more of a cog pattern. Feel that you could also have benefited from a more diffused light which would have prevented the glare on the first to cog flanges.</td>', 'Nice boarder, good shot, but feel the composition could have been improved if the chain was on the first or last cog, thus giving more of a cog pattern. Feel that you could also have benefited from a more diffused light which would have prevented the glare on the first to cog flanges.', '2003-05-01 15:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(285051, 20022, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. I like the colorin this photo. Your composition is good but it seems to have a snapshot quality. Perhaps shooting it from above would have made a good shot. (I don''t know how much control you had).</td>', 'Nice subject. I like the colorin this photo. Your composition is good but it seems to have a snapshot quality. Perhaps shooting it from above would have made a good shot. (I don''t know how much control you had).', '2003-05-01 15:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
