(285119, 20011, 7033, '<td valign="top">I love the idea you have going here and that spider web is both really cool and original. Unfortunately, the railcar is OOF and should be the focal point of the pic since the challenge is Transp. I suggest backing up a bit and catching the web with a little more light and a little less detail.</td>', 'I love the idea you have going here and that spider web is both really cool and original. Unfortunately, the railcar is OOF and should be the focal point of the pic since the challenge is Transp. I suggest backing up a bit and catching the web with a little more light and a little less detail.', '2003-05-01 15:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
