(285170, 19905, 509, '<td valign="top">My family''s Ford F250 was hit head on by a sleeping driver, it looked like yours, but I''m sure the impact is felt much harder by a smaller vehicle such as this one.  Hope nobody was hurt.  Good representation of damage.  I like the fence in the background as well, gives a simple, yet fitting background.</td>', 'My family''s Ford F250 was hit head on by a sleeping driver, it looked like yours, but I''m sure the impact is felt much harder by a smaller vehicle such as this one.  Hope nobody was hurt.  Good representation of damage.  I like the fence in the background as well, gives a simple, yet fitting background.', '2003-05-01 16:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
