(285566, 19975, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice shot... the clouds in the background really go nice with this.  Should have tried to darken them somehow.</td>', 'Pretty nice shot... the clouds in the background really go nice with this.  Should have tried to darken them somehow.', '2003-05-02 01:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
