(285572, 19933, 4494, '<td valign="top">Really perfect and life-like colors.  The rail and piers really give the shot good balance.</td>', 'Really perfect and life-like colors.  The rail and piers really give the shot good balance.', '2003-05-02 01:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
