(285670, 19899, 7711, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped out the bus to the left to keep the attention on the 3 double deckers in a row, maybe made the picture taller, like a portrait.<br/> <br/>king''s cross, eh? I''m going to hazard a guess that this is australia...</td>', 'I would have cropped out the bus to the left to keep the attention on the 3 double deckers in a row, maybe made the picture taller, like a portrait. king''s cross, eh? I''m going to hazard a guess that this is australia...', '2003-05-02 02:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(285672, 20046, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to figure out how to ride one of these! This shot really goes far in celebrating the unicycle.</td>', 'I''m trying to figure out how to ride one of these! This shot really goes far in celebrating the unicycle.', '2003-05-02 03:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(285673, 20058, 7706, '<td valign="top">I like the thought you have put into this shot. Its not just a boring snap shot of a car, its something different to every other photo. Color is cool, although a little dark near the top. However its a clear shot, nicely cropped, and borded looks good!</td>', 'I like the thought you have put into this shot. Its not just a boring snap shot of a car, its something different to every other photo. Color is cool, although a little dark near the top. However its a clear shot, nicely cropped, and borded looks good!', '2003-05-02 03:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(285674, 19730, 7711, '<td valign="top">far be it for me to be a "literal minded voter" but...this is too liberal of an interpretation of the challenge. Take your score with a grain of salt, I suspect it will depressed because of it. A good job of capturing the etheralness of the fog though.</td>', 'far be it for me to be a "literal minded voter" but...this is too liberal of an interpretation of the challenge. Take your score with a grain of salt, I suspect it will depressed because of it. A good job of capturing the etheralness of the fog though.', '2003-05-02 03:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(285675, 19773, 7711, '<td valign="top">I''m really glad you chose not to turn this black and white. Reminds me of the bluenose, I really like the contrast of it against the water and sky.</td>', 'I''m really glad you chose not to turn this black and white. Reminds me of the bluenose, I really like the contrast of it against the water and sky.', '2003-05-02 03:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(285676, 19637, 7706, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. I know it will do well. Colors are great, and the wet ness of the car and road adds a lot of texture to the photo. Also I guess helpds pick up on the reflection from the sun. I expect this photo will do very well.</td>', 'Fantastic shot. I know it will do well. Colors are great, and the wet ness of the car and road adds a lot of texture to the photo. Also I guess helpds pick up on the reflection from the sun. I expect this photo will do very well.', '2003-05-02 03:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
