(285704, 19370, 6172, '<td valign="top">Definitely like the car.  Don''t like the crop(why so much empty foreground?).  Why is this photo b/w?  I don''t see how that could have possibly enhanced it any, unless the car is an ugly primer gray(never seen a Ferrari that wasn''t colorful.)</td>', 'Definitely like the car.  Don''t like the crop(why so much empty foreground?).  Why is this photo b/w?  I don''t see how that could have possibly enhanced it any, unless the car is an ugly primer gray(never seen a Ferrari that wasn''t colorful.)', '2003-05-02 04:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(285709, 19381, 3669, '<td valign="top">I looked at this picture for a long time and the more I looked at it, the more I started to like it.    While the shoes are out of focus, the object in the background is...I can''t quite figure out exactly what it is.  I''m thinking perhaps part of a stadium seat.  Am I right or even  close?  I''m trying to think of a symbolic reasoning for the shoes to be OOF, but can''t quite put my finger on it.  Perhaps they are set aside for some activity that can''t be seen beyond the "seat".   I''m not sure if you meant the picture to be grainy, but I think if it were cleaned up, it would look a lot better.  A program called Neat Image would clean that up nicely.  A free demo is available on the internet for download, if you are interested.  In any event, for my peaked interest in this photo, I gave you a 6.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I looked at this picture for a long time and the more I looked at it, the more I started to like it.    While the shoes are out of focus, the object in the background is...I can''t quite figure out exactly what it is.  I''m thinking perhaps part of a stadium seat.  Am I right or even  close?  I''m trying to think of a symbolic reasoning for the shoes to be OOF, but can''t quite put my finger on it.  Perhaps they are set aside for some activity that can''t be seen beyond the "seat".   I''m not sure if you meant the picture to be grainy, but I think if it were cleaned up, it would look a lot better.  A program called Neat Image would clean that up nicely.  A free demo is available on the internet for download, if you are interested.  In any event, for my peaked interest in this photo, I gave you a 6.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-05-02 04:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(285711, 19593, 3669, '<td valign="top">Definately meets challenge.  The lighting is good and focus is excellent.  Perhaps shooting the wagon closer and at a different angle where it would show more detail would make this a little more interesting.  Like the chipped paint on the wheel, the wooden construction of the wagon or the ropes that hold the covering in place.  It''s just a thought.  All in all, as a whole, it is technically a nice photograh in my opinion  -7-  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Definately meets challenge.  The lighting is good and focus is excellent.  Perhaps shooting the wagon closer and at a different angle where it would show more detail would make this a little more interesting.  Like the chipped paint on the wheel, the wooden construction of the wagon or the ropes that hold the covering in place.  It''s just a thought.  All in all, as a whole, it is technically a nice photograh in my opinion  -7-  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-05-02 04:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(285713, 19439, 4767, '<td valign="top">What a leisurely way to travel!  What a great shot showing this unique, delightful mode of transportation.  (NEXT year I''m hoping to visit the canal du midi like this!)<br/></td>', 'What a leisurely way to travel!  What a great shot showing this unique, delightful mode of transportation.  (NEXT year I''m hoping to visit the canal du midi like this!)', '2003-05-02 04:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(285715, 19631, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  It feels SO black and white, then the tan inside of the boot top shows... a nice touch.  Well done!</td>', 'Nice photo.  It feels SO black and white, then the tan inside of the boot top shows... a nice touch.  Well done!', '2003-05-02 04:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(285717, 19914, 3669, '<td valign="top">You almost can''t tell that this was actually a boat at one time, however, it definately is.  This has got to be the winner for the week.  The lighting is excellent...I love the colors and reflections of the beautiful water.  Then, in contrast, is the ugliness of the boat or what is left of it.  You show great detail of the peeling paint and the moss collecting on the surfaces of the portion in the water.  I like the angle at which it was shot, with the back portion of the boat trailing off into the shadows.  Very clean and well framed.  What more can I say, but WOW  10+   My favorite for this challenge.</td>', 'You almost can''t tell that this was actually a boat at one time, however, it definately is.  This has got to be the winner for the week.  The lighting is excellent...I love the colors and reflections of the beautiful water.  Then, in contrast, is the ugliness of the boat or what is left of it.  You show great detail of the peeling paint and the moss collecting on the surfaces of the portion in the water.  I like the angle at which it was shot, with the back portion of the boat trailing off into the shadows.  Very clean and well framed.  What more can I say, but WOW  10+   My favorite for this challenge.', '2003-05-02 04:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(285718, 19735, 4767, '<td valign="top">Why do I hear Canned Heat singing "Goin'' Up The Country" when I look at this shot???  Peace, man!</td>', 'Why do I hear Canned Heat singing "Goin'' Up The Country" when I look at this shot???  Peace, man!', '2003-05-02 04:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(285720, 20056, 3669, '<td valign="top">This one makes me laugh...thank-you.   I like the positioning of the riding lawnmower man in your picture with the vastness of the empty road beside him.  Now, all he has to do is hand signal a right hand turn and I would laugh even more.  The sepia tone to the photo is effective.  I don''t even mind the blowen out sky.  I just wish it was more in focus.  -8-  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This one makes me laugh...thank-you.   I like the positioning of the riding lawnmower man in your picture with the vastness of the empty road beside him.  Now, all he has to do is hand signal a right hand turn and I would laugh even more.  The sepia tone to the photo is effective.  I don''t even mind the blowen out sky.  I just wish it was more in focus.  -8-  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-05-02 04:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(285721, 19861, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very nice take on the challenge.  Very effective!</td>', 'Very nice take on the challenge.  Very effective!', '2003-05-02 05:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(285752, 19729, 3579, '<td valign="top">I like the crop here. Perhaps using a slower shutter speed and panning on the train on the left would have given more of a sense of motion. As it is, it looks like both trains are stationary.</td>', 'I like the crop here. Perhaps using a slower shutter speed and panning on the train on the left would have given more of a sense of motion. As it is, it looks like both trains are stationary.', '2003-05-02 07:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(285754, 20021, 3579, '<td valign="top">The angled light gives some great shadows here. I find that the blown highlights make it too difficult for me to look at it for any length of time.  It''d probably look better in print than on the monitor.</td>', 'The angled light gives some great shadows here. I find that the blown highlights make it too difficult for me to look at it for any length of time.  It''d probably look better in print than on the monitor.', '2003-05-02 07:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(285758, 20030, 3579, '<td valign="top">I feel it would have looked even better on a dirt road, with the horse in motion. With the horse stopped, it gives me the feeling that nothing is happening.</td>', 'I feel it would have looked even better on a dirt road, with the horse in motion. With the horse stopped, it gives me the feeling that nothing is happening.', '2003-05-02 07:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(285759, 20047, 3579, '<td valign="top">I like the warm tones in this photo. The growth in and around it give it a great ''being reclaimed by nature'' feel.</td>', 'I like the warm tones in this photo. The growth in and around it give it a great ''being reclaimed by nature'' feel.', '2003-05-02 07:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(285760, 20011, 3579, '<td valign="top">It seems as though you''re trying to use the web as a symbol of abandonment of the car, but the closeness of the crop makes it difficult for me to get a sense of the vehicle itself.</td>', 'It seems as though you''re trying to use the web as a symbol of abandonment of the car, but the closeness of the crop makes it difficult for me to get a sense of the vehicle itself.', '2003-05-02 07:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(285761, 19632, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the sense of motion and the crop is good, giving a sense of the bike moving through the picture. The sepia looks good too.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the sense of motion and the crop is good, giving a sense of the bike moving through the picture. The sepia looks good too.', '2003-05-02 08:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(285762, 19995, 3579, '<td valign="top">I really like the exposure level on the train here. It looks great in black and white. I think there''s too much blur and sense of motion on the two women on the left, which distracts me from the rest of the photo.</td>', 'I really like the exposure level on the train here. It looks great in black and white. I think there''s too much blur and sense of motion on the two women on the left, which distracts me from the rest of the photo.', '2003-05-02 08:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(285763, 19906, 3579, '<td valign="top">Interesting crop here. The shot is nice and sharp, but I find the discolouration on the door a little distracting.</td>', 'Interesting crop here. The shot is nice and sharp, but I find the discolouration on the door a little distracting.', '2003-05-02 08:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(285764, 19974, 3579, '<td valign="top">I like the angle on the shot. It gives an indication of the wacky gradients on the streets there. Great sky colour too.</td>', 'I like the angle on the shot. It gives an indication of the wacky gradients on the streets there. Great sky colour too.', '2003-05-02 08:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(285765, 19975, 3579, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. I like the sepia toning and contrast. It would have been nice to see just a little more of the tracks further down the street to give more perspective, but I guess you would''t want to get run over :)</td>', 'Lovely shot. I like the sepia toning and contrast. It would have been nice to see just a little more of the tracks further down the street to give more perspective, but I guess you would''t want to get run over :)', '2003-05-02 08:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(285766, 20041, 8274, '<td valign="top">I think this picture is possibly pushing the boundaries of the contest subject, as a sunset it is reasonable, although the horizon is not level.</td>', 'I think this picture is possibly pushing the boundaries of the contest subject, as a sunset it is reasonable, although the horizon is not level.', '2003-05-02 08:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(285767, 19460, 3579, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. It conveys a sense of motion well.</td>', 'Interesting idea. It conveys a sense of motion well.', '2003-05-02 08:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(285768, 20012, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. It''s a pity about the distracting wingtip of the plane next to it. Good day for a flight though!</td>', 'Nice shot. It''s a pity about the distracting wingtip of the plane next to it. Good day for a flight though!', '2003-05-02 08:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(285769, 19937, 8274, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, good exposure and colour</td>', 'Interesting photo, good exposure and colour', '2003-05-02 08:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(285770, 19915, 3579, '<td valign="top">I like the leading lines of the fence. I think taking a step backward might have allowed you to get all of the bike in, which I think would have made for a better shot. I''d like to see the shot in sepia too!</td>', 'I like the leading lines of the fence. I think taking a step backward might have allowed you to get all of the bike in, which I think would have made for a better shot. I''d like to see the shot in sepia too!', '2003-05-02 08:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(285771, 19983, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and lines of the road. Does the title refer to the wheels, or the lady on the motorised cart? Or both :)</td>', 'Nice DOF and lines of the road. Does the title refer to the wheels, or the lady on the motorised cart? Or both :)', '2003-05-02 08:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(285772, 19692, 3579, '<td valign="top">I think you can see your outline in the reflection, which detracts somewhat from the shot. I find the various bits and pieces a bit distracting in the shot, but I like the dominant red colour.</td>', 'I think you can see your outline in the reflection, which detracts somewhat from the shot. I find the various bits and pieces a bit distracting in the shot, but I like the dominant red colour.', '2003-05-02 08:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(285773, 19701, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the reflection going through the picture. I think that the letters are a tad too close to the edges of the frame though. It almost looks like they''re chopped.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the reflection going through the picture. I think that the letters are a tad too close to the edges of the frame though. It almost looks like they''re chopped.', '2003-05-02 08:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(285774, 19738, 3579, '<td valign="top">Some of the training wheel is missing from the shot. I think it would have looked better to have it all in (and maybe a kid''s shoe ready to use it)</td>', 'Some of the training wheel is missing from the shot. I think it would have looked better to have it all in (and maybe a kid''s shoe ready to use it)', '2003-05-02 08:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(285775, 19661, 3579, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I like the main reflection on the wheel.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I like the main reflection on the wheel.', '2003-05-02 08:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(285776, 19703, 8274, '<td valign="top">This could have a much better shot with a better angle and cropping, none the less it is a deserving original in this contest.</td>', 'This could have a much better shot with a better angle and cropping, none the less it is a deserving original in this contest.', '2003-05-02 08:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(285777, 19555, 8274, '<td valign="top">Excellent colour and exposure.</td>', 'Excellent colour and exposure.', '2003-05-02 08:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(285782, 19966, 8274, '<td valign="top">A nice exposure and interesting subject.</td>', 'A nice exposure and interesting subject.', '2003-05-02 08:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(285783, 20059, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice use of pattern here. the desaturation of red/green makes the blue stand out very nicely with the chrome of the handlebars. If you could spot edit out the bits of blue in the flowerbed and on the road, it''d look even better!</td>', 'Nice use of pattern here. the desaturation of red/green makes the blue stand out very nicely with the chrome of the handlebars. If you could spot edit out the bits of blue in the flowerbed and on the road, it''d look even better!', '2003-05-02 08:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(285784, 20009, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice lines on the bonnet. It''s a pity about the tree shadows - I think they detract from the shot somewhat.</td>', 'Nice lines on the bonnet. It''s a pity about the tree shadows - I think they detract from the shot somewhat.', '2003-05-02 08:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(285785, 19249, 8274, '<td valign="top">Your photo is original in this contest that is dominated by steam monsters from the past a various angles, moods and settings.</td>', 'Your photo is original in this contest that is dominated by steam monsters from the past a various angles, moods and settings.', '2003-05-02 08:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(285786, 20022, 8274, '<td valign="top">Excellent colour and exposure, although the cropping is a little severe, perhaps the situation did not lend itself to filling all the car.</td>', 'Excellent colour and exposure, although the cropping is a little severe, perhaps the situation did not lend itself to filling all the car.', '2003-05-02 08:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(285787, 19973, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The overcast day gives nice even lighting here. I find the depth of field makes the gloves blend in somewhat oddly with the flowering bush in the background, which is a little distracting. Still, a nice arrangement!</td>', 'Nice composition. The overcast day gives nice even lighting here. I find the depth of field makes the gloves blend in somewhat oddly with the flowering bush in the background, which is a little distracting. Still, a nice arrangement!', '2003-05-02 08:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(285788, 20012, 8274, '<td valign="top">Whilst having excellent exposure and colour you could have placed the model better.</td>', 'Whilst having excellent exposure and colour you could have placed the model better.', '2003-05-02 08:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(285789, 19606, 3579, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see a tighter crop of the man tending to his horse with the buggies in the background, or perhaps the horse over to the right, with the buggy out of focus. The current composition is too busy.</td>', 'I would have liked to see a tighter crop of the man tending to his horse with the buggies in the background, or perhaps the horse over to the right, with the buggy out of focus. The current composition is too busy.', '2003-05-02 08:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(285790, 19588, 3579, '<td valign="top">Pedal power! Nice use of b&amp;w. The clouds add a great element of interest, making it look like he/she''s off into a windy patch. Nice work.</td>', 'Pedal power! Nice use of b&w. The clouds add a great element of interest, making it look like he/she''s off into a windy patch. Nice work.', '2003-05-02 08:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(285792, 20024, 3579, '<td valign="top">I like the grainy effect on the jeans, and the use of perspective. Interesting shot!</td>', 'I like the grainy effect on the jeans, and the use of perspective. Interesting shot!', '2003-05-02 08:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(285793, 20058, 8274, '<td valign="top">Definately a sense of pwer from the shot, not sure about the colour.</td>', 'Definately a sense of pwer from the shot, not sure about the colour.', '2003-05-02 08:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(285794, 19981, 3579, '<td valign="top">Are these gummy cars? Looking at the bright colours gives me the munchies :)<br/> <br/>It looks like the second car from the front has the sharpest focus, but I think the first car would have looked better. Interesting colours though!</td>', 'Are these gummy cars? Looking at the bright colours gives me the munchies :) It looks like the second car from the front has the sharpest focus, but I think the first car would have looked better. Interesting colours though!', '2003-05-02 08:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(285796, 19966, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp shot. It''s a pity that the ropes are covering the boat''s name.</td>', 'Nice crisp shot. It''s a pity that the ropes are covering the boat''s name.', '2003-05-02 08:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(285797, 19868, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice clean composition.</td>', 'Nice clean composition.', '2003-05-02 08:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(285798, 19455, 3579, '<td valign="top">If the train had been more prominent in the shot, I think it would have made for a greater juxtaposition to the peaceful street around. You really have to go looking for the train to know at a glance that it''s a rail bridge (unless you''re from the area, which I''m not). I think the positioning of the shot is otherwise spot on.</td>', 'If the train had been more prominent in the shot, I think it would have made for a greater juxtaposition to the peaceful street around. You really have to go looking for the train to know at a glance that it''s a rail bridge (unless you''re from the area, which I''m not). I think the positioning of the shot is otherwise spot on.', '2003-05-02 08:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(285799, 19965, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry in the shot.</td>', 'Nice symmetry in the shot.', '2003-05-02 09:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(285801, 20051, 8274, '<td valign="top">An excellent composure, see an opportunity and grab it !</td>', 'An excellent composure, see an opportunity and grab it !', '2003-05-02 09:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(285802, 19488, 3579, '<td valign="top">I think I''ll walk :) I think getting in a little closer and maybe even getting the driver more into the shot (assuming he was amenable to the idea) would have improved on the composition.</td>', 'I think I''ll walk :) I think getting in a little closer and maybe even getting the driver more into the shot (assuming he was amenable to the idea) would have improved on the composition.', '2003-05-02 09:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(285803, 20055, 3579, '<td valign="top">The placement of the cycle is good, but the pole in the background and the lack of focus are a bit distracting.</td>', 'The placement of the cycle is good, but the pole in the background and the lack of focus are a bit distracting.', '2003-05-02 09:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(285804, 19511, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I really like the shadow of the boat. It makes it look like a fin carving through the water. Great work!</td>', 'Nice composition. I really like the shadow of the boat. It makes it look like a fin carving through the water. Great work!', '2003-05-02 09:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(285806, 19967, 8274, '<td valign="top">If you could get rid of or clone that red tube out this shot would be so much better. It is better than the thumbnail suggests however.</td>', 'If you could get rid of or clone that red tube out this shot would be so much better. It is better than the thumbnail suggests however.', '2003-05-02 09:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(285807, 19899, 3579, '<td valign="top">A wonderfully (frightfully?) typical look at traffic in London :)</td>', 'A wonderfully (frightfully?) typical look at traffic in London :)', '2003-05-02 09:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(285808, 19910, 3579, '<td valign="top">An interesting look at how some people are required to get around!</td>', 'An interesting look at how some people are required to get around!', '2003-05-02 09:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(285809, 20028, 8274, '<td valign="top">An interesting picture, I like the yellow lines being left in. I think the truck distracts a little.</td>', 'An interesting picture, I like the yellow lines being left in. I think the truck distracts a little.', '2003-05-02 09:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(285810, 19887, 3579, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit on the dark side. Could have done with some more exposure here. With a bit more light, you could have done something interesting with the nice contrast between the tracks/ground/shadows and the car rooftops and the sky.</td>', 'It''s a bit on the dark side. Could have done with some more exposure here. With a bit more light, you could have done something interesting with the nice contrast between the tracks/ground/shadows and the car rooftops and the sky.', '2003-05-02 09:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(285812, 19718, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and desaturation.</td>', 'Nice perspective and desaturation.', '2003-05-02 09:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(285813, 19974, 7743, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  Well composed.  Good exposure as well.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  Well composed.  Good exposure as well.', '2003-05-02 09:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(285814, 19404, 3579, '<td valign="top">Lovely horses</td>', 'Lovely horses', '2003-05-02 09:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(285815, 19718, 8274, '<td valign="top">A very nice use of colour and original subject</td>', 'A very nice use of colour and original subject', '2003-05-02 09:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(285817, 19796, 3579, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.</td>', 'Cute shot.', '2003-05-02 09:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(285818, 19923, 7743, '<td valign="top">Red is a very strong colour and distracts the viewer from the main subject.  More impact would have been achieved if the odd one out was the red bike instead of the black one.  Another thing to try would be to have the odd one out about 2/3 of the way back and use depth of field to blur the foreground and background.</td>', 'Red is a very strong colour and distracts the viewer from the main subject.  More impact would have been achieved if the odd one out was the red bike instead of the black one.  Another thing to try would be to have the odd one out about 2/3 of the way back and use depth of field to blur the foreground and background.', '2003-05-02 09:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(285819, 19818, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of perspective.  To give this image even more impact you could include more of the grill or even the entire grill but keep the roof of the car in the picture.  You might have to back off a little to keep all this in the frame.</td>', 'I like your choice of perspective.  To give this image even more impact you could include more of the grill or even the entire grill but keep the roof of the car in the picture.  You might have to back off a little to keep all this in the frame.', '2003-05-02 09:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(285821, 19667, 3579, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot</td>', 'Interesting shot', '2003-05-02 09:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(285823, 19843, 3579, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrast between the wreck and the forest - it almost looks like it''s been superimposed.</td>', 'Interesting contrast between the wreck and the forest - it almost looks like it''s been superimposed.', '2003-05-02 09:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(285832, 20020, 8274, '<td valign="top">Certainly a sense of size and power conveyed.</td>', 'Certainly a sense of size and power conveyed.', '2003-05-02 09:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(285833, 19910, 7743, '<td valign="top">This is a good documentary shot.  It doesn''t have much impact though.</td>', 'This is a good documentary shot.  It doesn''t have much impact though.', '2003-05-02 09:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(285834, 19891, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective you chose.   It has more impact as apposed to a straight, level shot.  Well exposed and composed as well.</td>', 'I like the perspective you chose.   It has more impact as apposed to a straight, level shot.  Well exposed and composed as well.', '2003-05-02 09:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(285835, 19591, 7743, '<td valign="top">The speed of the chase is well captured here.  For more impact you might have left more space in front of the calf.</td>', 'The speed of the chase is well captured here.  For more impact you might have left more space in front of the calf.', '2003-05-02 09:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(285836, 19267, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice clean lines. The subject is not very prominent in the picture.</td>', 'Nice clean lines. The subject is not very prominent in the picture.', '2003-05-02 09:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(285837, 19783, 7743, '<td valign="top">The overexposed sky takes away from the impact of this image.  I realize this was done to bring out the detail in the bridge.  Another perspective may have solved this issue - taking the picture from the other side.</td>', 'The overexposed sky takes away from the impact of this image.  I realize this was done to bring out the detail in the bridge.  Another perspective may have solved this issue - taking the picture from the other side.', '2003-05-02 09:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(285838, 19895, 7743, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the reflection of the map though the actual map in the bottom right is distracting since it is quite bright.  To improve on this you could try cropping out more of the map from the bottom or using depth of field to blur the foreground.</td>', 'I like the idea of the reflection of the map though the actual map in the bottom right is distracting since it is quite bright.  To improve on this you could try cropping out more of the map from the bottom or using depth of field to blur the foreground.', '2003-05-02 09:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(285841, 19591, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot.</td>', 'Nice action shot.', '2003-05-02 10:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
