(286410, 19915, 7711, '<td valign="top">ok, this is the second time I''m trying to comment/vote on this shot! What I wanted to say was take a few steps back from the bike to get it all in the shot and you can still take advantage of the great lines created by the fence, which I really like. However, the colours are a bit washed out and the picture is a bit too bright. Perhaps some saturation and playing a bit with the levels in photoshop could have helped? :)</td>', 'ok, this is the second time I''m trying to comment/vote on this shot! What I wanted to say was take a few steps back from the bike to get it all in the shot and you can still take advantage of the great lines created by the fence, which I really like. However, the colours are a bit washed out and the picture is a bit too bright. Perhaps some saturation and playing a bit with the levels in photoshop could have helped? :)', '2003-05-03 02:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(286412, 19969, 7711, '<td valign="top">wow. the colours of that fisher''s clothes, and the rippled mirror reflections of the water contrasted with the fisher and the boat REALLY make this shot for me. I adore it, including that errant bird in the back. Our fisher could use a little bit more focus though, he seems blurred a bit and pixely near his arm. Lovely capture in any event, well done!</td>', 'wow. the colours of that fisher''s clothes, and the rippled mirror reflections of the water contrasted with the fisher and the boat REALLY make this shot for me. I adore it, including that errant bird in the back. Our fisher could use a little bit more focus though, he seems blurred a bit and pixely near his arm. Lovely capture in any event, well done!', '2003-05-03 02:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(286416, 19893, 7711, '<td valign="top">whoa! the colours are really really strange on this one. Subject is nice, but the post processing is not doing it justice at all. The grass is an unnatural colour, as is the sky and the load on the wagon.</td>', 'whoa! the colours are really really strange on this one. Subject is nice, but the post processing is not doing it justice at all. The grass is an unnatural colour, as is the sky and the load on the wagon.', '2003-05-03 02:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
