(286460, 19692, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, however there seems to be too many competing elements here, ie. the black barrs on top,the thing in the bottom right, and the reflection.  I love the colour though.</td>', 'Nice concept, however there seems to be too many competing elements here, ie. the black barrs on top,the thing in the bottom right, and the reflection.  I love the colour though.', '2003-05-03 08:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
