(286462, 19969, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections. The colours on the raincoat almost look too saturated. Although the bird taking off with a fish in the corner of the shot does provide some interest, I think it is distracting overall. I think cropping closer to get just the fisherman and his boat and including less of the water (that part without the reflections) would have made for a stronger composition. There''s still something to it though.</td>', 'Nice reflections. The colours on the raincoat almost look too saturated. Although the bird taking off with a fish in the corner of the shot does provide some interest, I think it is distracting overall. I think cropping closer to get just the fisherman and his boat and including less of the water (that part without the reflections) would have made for a stronger composition. There''s still something to it though.', '2003-05-03 08:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(286466, 19741, 8274, '<td valign="top">I like the fluidness about the lighting, even on the rear of the car.</td>', 'I like the fluidness about the lighting, even on the rear of the car.', '2003-05-03 08:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(286468, 19886, 8274, '<td valign="top">I am still trying to work out how this picture was taken. I think the cars are models, sorry if I am wrong.</td>', 'I am still trying to work out how this picture was taken. I think the cars are models, sorry if I am wrong.', '2003-05-03 08:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(286472, 19783, 8274, '<td valign="top">Certainly a sense of tropical lushness is captured.</td>', 'Certainly a sense of tropical lushness is captured.', '2003-05-03 09:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(286474, 20008, 8274, '<td valign="top">Excellent work</td>', 'Excellent work', '2003-05-03 09:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(286476, 19971, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice angle however I''d like to see the sidewalk a bit cleaner.  Looks a bit distracting with the (leaves)?<br/></td>', 'Nice angle however I''d like to see the sidewalk a bit cleaner.  Looks a bit distracting with the (leaves)?', '2003-05-03 09:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(286477, 20047, 8274, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better old wrecked car shots in the contest</td>', 'This is one of the better old wrecked car shots in the contest', '2003-05-03 09:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(286478, 19969, 2716, '<td valign="top">They look a bit blown out but I like the intensity of the colours.  Very interesting elements and an added bonus with the seagull.  Jacko  8</td>', 'They look a bit blown out but I like the intensity of the colours.  Very interesting elements and an added bonus with the seagull.  Jacko  8', '2003-05-03 09:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(286479, 20053, 8274, '<td valign="top">Old faithful certainly has a mean set of tyres.</td>', 'Old faithful certainly has a mean set of tyres.', '2003-05-03 09:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(286480, 19777, 2716, '<td valign="top">Grood eye.  I could crop out some of th e right side and top to remove alot of the wires.  Still a great shot.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'Grood eye.  I could crop out some of th e right side and top to remove alot of the wires.  Still a great shot.  Jacko.  8', '2003-05-03 09:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(286481, 20021, 2716, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Has that high key look to it.  I don''t understand the title but that''s OK.  I can see how boots relate to transportation.  Good job with the the B&amp;W.  Very nice tones.  Jacko.  my first 10.</td>', 'Love it.  Has that high key look to it.  I don''t understand the title but that''s OK.  I can see how boots relate to transportation.  Good job with the the B&W.  Very nice tones.  Jacko.  my first 10.', '2003-05-03 09:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
