(286520, 19784, 2389, '<td valign="top">My truck is covered with this stuff... Interesting idea, I would have never thought of it. The soft foreground and background is effective, especially the subtle colors.</td>', 'My truck is covered with this stuff... Interesting idea, I would have never thought of it. The soft foreground and background is effective, especially the subtle colors.', '2003-05-03 12:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
