(286537, 20024, 7504, '<td valign="top">I like this image very much.  The choice of b&amp;w I think was a good one.  The perspective is good, and I like the movement.</td>', 'I like this image very much.  The choice of b&w I think was a good one.  The perspective is good, and I like the movement.', '2003-05-03 13:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
