(286716, 20016, 543, '<td valign="top">This looks like a great subject and location, but it''s not working for me.  I really miss seeing all of the tail, and the fantastic roof kind of swallows up the wings and wood bits of the plane.  I don''t know if there''s anything you could do about the tail if there was something in the way there, but the right B/W conversion would make the plane stand out better.</td>', 'This looks like a great subject and location, but it''s not working for me.  I really miss seeing all of the tail, and the fantastic roof kind of swallows up the wings and wood bits of the plane.  I don''t know if there''s anything you could do about the tail if there was something in the way there, but the right B/W conversion would make the plane stand out better.', '2003-05-03 22:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(286718, 19866, 554, '<td valign="top">first, I like the simple framing of this horse.  Three things I object to are---I don''t like the rope dangeling from the bit---the post behind the front legs---and the green and brown whatsit behind the head..........</td>', 'first, I like the simple framing of this horse.  Three things I object to are---I don''t like the rope dangeling from the bit---the post behind the front legs---and the green and brown whatsit behind the head..........', '2003-05-03 22:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
