(286822, 19631, 7743, '<td valign="top">The lighting is harsh.  The position of the boots in the frame works but a plain white background has no impact.  Maybe with a different background and if the boots were a bit scuffed up (after an exercise and before you polish them again) you could generate some impact.</td>', 'The lighting is harsh.  The position of the boots in the frame works but a plain white background has no impact.  Maybe with a different background and if the boots were a bit scuffed up (after an exercise and before you polish them again) you could generate some impact.', '2003-05-04 01:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(286823, 19886, 3540, '<td valign="top">The cars not being clear is the first thing I notice about this.  The fact that I don''t think they are real cars is the second strike.  The third strike is that the "fireworks" look more like sparklers to me.  Honestly you''ve almost pulled it off.  I would''ve opted out of the cars if the challenge were not transportation.  The fireworks have some appeal as is.</td>', 'The cars not being clear is the first thing I notice about this.  The fact that I don''t think they are real cars is the second strike.  The third strike is that the "fireworks" look more like sparklers to me.  Honestly you''ve almost pulled it off.  I would''ve opted out of the cars if the challenge were not transportation.  The fireworks have some appeal as is.', '2003-05-04 01:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(286824, 19964, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good night time image. A little cluttered.</td>', 'Good night time image. A little cluttered.', '2003-05-04 01:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(286826, 20041, 8442, '<td valign="top">I like this photo very very much. The problem is the theme of the pictures. The little boat there looks very insignificant in comparison with the sea and the sky. Ok.. it''s truth... that also sounds like a justification to put it in the category, but if somebody put me to choose a photo related with the current topic of Transportation... this definately is not a good choice. I will make my calification in order to respect the beauty of this picture.</td>', 'I like this photo very very much. The problem is the theme of the pictures. The little boat there looks very insignificant in comparison with the sea and the sky. Ok.. it''s truth... that also sounds like a justification to put it in the category, but if somebody put me to choose a photo related with the current topic of Transportation... this definately is not a good choice. I will make my calification in order to respect the beauty of this picture.', '2003-05-04 01:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(286828, 19998, 8442, '<td valign="top">Good picture, shave your legs, eat more!</td>', 'Good picture, shave your legs, eat more!', '2003-05-04 01:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
