(286850, 19599, 7711, '<td valign="top">at the risk of incurring too many groans for making bad jokes, the colours here are too... plain. The shot seems to lack any real point of interest, besides the rolls royce sticker on the engine!</td>', 'at the risk of incurring too many groans for making bad jokes, the colours here are too... plain. The shot seems to lack any real point of interest, besides the rolls royce sticker on the engine!', '2003-05-04 02:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(286851, 19904, 7711, '<td valign="top">I can''t say I agree with your choice of post processing, it makes the picture look more like a drawing or technicolour colourization than a digital photo, but I do like the elements you chose to include in this shot, though busy, they have a lot of character.</td>', 'I can''t say I agree with your choice of post processing, it makes the picture look more like a drawing or technicolour colourization than a digital photo, but I do like the elements you chose to include in this shot, though busy, they have a lot of character.', '2003-05-04 02:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(286852, 20043, 7711, '<td valign="top">a head on shot of all this, rather than the sharp angle you have would make this feel less like we are all sliding off a desk or something, but nice idea and cute composition. :) The sepia makes it look more like a WWII invasion plan than the notion of travel thought..just a thought.</td>', 'a head on shot of all this, rather than the sharp angle you have would make this feel less like we are all sliding off a desk or something, but nice idea and cute composition. :) The sepia makes it look more like a WWII invasion plan than the notion of travel thought..just a thought.', '2003-05-04 02:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(286853, 19366, 7711, '<td valign="top">what a sad and tragic reality to capture. I wish the items in the cart didn''t blend in with the bushes as much as they do, the background is too busy to keep the focus on the shopping cart and really communicate your message.</td>', 'what a sad and tragic reality to capture. I wish the items in the cart didn''t blend in with the bushes as much as they do, the background is too busy to keep the focus on the shopping cart and really communicate your message.', '2003-05-04 02:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(286854, 19666, 7711, '<td valign="top">i think I''d have preferred to see the entire body of the horses rather than just their arses! nice idea though. The white drum in the back is distracting...I can''t say I agree with your composition choice. But! you are in focus and your colours are vibrant! :)</td>', 'i think I''d have preferred to see the entire body of the horses rather than just their arses! nice idea though. The white drum in the back is distracting...I can''t say I agree with your composition choice. But! you are in focus and your colours are vibrant! :)', '2003-05-04 02:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(286855, 19699, 7711, '<td valign="top">i''m glad there were some people in here, makes the shot all that more interesting. Nice focus, and I like the sun pouring in through the windows. I am curious as to what this looked like in colour. I have this imagination that the wood tones must be beautiful. :)</td>', 'i''m glad there were some people in here, makes the shot all that more interesting. Nice focus, and I like the sun pouring in through the windows. I am curious as to what this looked like in colour. I have this imagination that the wood tones must be beautiful. :)', '2003-05-04 02:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(286857, 19868, 7711, '<td valign="top">bluer sky through PS manipulation? and maybe a bit of a crop off the top, otherwise, nice shot, I like your choice of vertical/portrait crop. :)</td>', 'bluer sky through PS manipulation? and maybe a bit of a crop off the top, otherwise, nice shot, I like your choice of vertical/portrait crop. :)', '2003-05-04 02:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(286858, 20009, 5007, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you used the light for this photo. Nice rich colors.</td>', 'I really like the way you used the light for this photo. Nice rich colors.', '2003-05-04 02:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(286859, 19863, 5007, '<td valign="top">I wish the small part of the other car in the lower right hand corner was not there. But we are really constrained by not being allowed to spot edit. Otherwise its a nice shot.</td>', 'I wish the small part of the other car in the lower right hand corner was not there. But we are really constrained by not being allowed to spot edit. Otherwise its a nice shot.', '2003-05-04 02:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(286861, 19903, 5007, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, it is original and features just the car without distracting back or fore grounds.</td>', 'I like this shot, it is original and features just the car without distracting back or fore grounds.', '2003-05-04 02:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(286863, 19404, 5007, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this photo except the busy background. It tends to cause the horses and buggy to blend in to the background. Especially because the foreground is so simple. It is still a nice photo though.</td>', 'I like everything about this photo except the busy background. It tends to cause the horses and buggy to blend in to the background. Especially because the foreground is so simple. It is still a nice photo though.', '2003-05-04 02:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(286864, 19914, 5007, '<td valign="top">I really like the simple lines and colors of this photo. It really sets a mood.</td>', 'I really like the simple lines and colors of this photo. It really sets a mood.', '2003-05-04 02:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(286865, 19706, 5007, '<td valign="top">The car kind of blends into the busy background. I think cars are the hardest things to photograph because of the distractions around it.</td>', 'The car kind of blends into the busy background. I think cars are the hardest things to photograph because of the distractions around it.', '2003-05-04 02:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(286866, 20044, 5007, '<td valign="top">Wow. I would love to hear how you did this. It worked great and is a very nice photo.</td>', 'Wow. I would love to hear how you did this. It worked great and is a very nice photo.', '2003-05-04 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(286868, 20031, 2978, '<td valign="top">Nice shot bu tI would be more careful of the reflection.</td>', 'Nice shot bu tI would be more careful of the reflection.', '2003-05-04 02:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(286869, 19686, 5007, '<td valign="top">Nice car photo. You did a great job finding the right back and foreground. It makes the car stand out and hold your attention. Nice color saturation and focus is clear and sharp.</td>', 'Nice car photo. You did a great job finding the right back and foreground. It makes the car stand out and hold your attention. Nice color saturation and focus is clear and sharp.', '2003-05-04 02:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(286870, 19954, 5007, '<td valign="top">Brrr... looks like summer is a long way off... is that snow on the motors?</td>', 'Brrr... looks like summer is a long way off... is that snow on the motors?', '2003-05-04 02:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(286871, 19937, 5007, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  This gave me vertigo! A very interesting shot of an unusual site.</td>', 'Whoa!  This gave me vertigo! A very interesting shot of an unusual site.', '2003-05-04 02:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(286872, 19997, 2978, '<td valign="top">This is magnificent. It reminds me of a quiet evening alone. Good luck</td>', 'This is magnificent. It reminds me of a quiet evening alone. Good luck', '2003-05-04 02:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(286873, 19906, 5007, '<td valign="top">Nice job of panning while keeping the passengers and car in sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice job of panning while keeping the passengers and car in sharp focus.', '2003-05-04 02:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(286874, 20060, 5007, '<td valign="top">I think the background is too cluttered and takes the eye away from the main subject. If you had tried placing the cycle on a grassy knoll or on sand or something similar, the bike would really stand out better.</td>', 'I think the background is too cluttered and takes the eye away from the main subject. If you had tried placing the cycle on a grassy knoll or on sand or something similar, the bike would really stand out better.', '2003-05-04 02:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(286875, 20056, 5007, '<td valign="top">LOL! Great title!</td>', 'LOL! Great title!', '2003-05-04 02:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(286876, 19931, 5007, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, just wish it were bigger.</td>', 'Neat shot, just wish it were bigger.', '2003-05-04 02:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(286877, 19963, 5007, '<td valign="top">Nice saturation and lighting. I like the color contrasts and lines in this photo.</td>', 'Nice saturation and lighting. I like the color contrasts and lines in this photo.', '2003-05-04 02:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(286878, 19903, 7711, '<td valign="top">something in your processing has created strange artifacts on the thin lines in the photo, like the red line details and the antenna. otherwise good angle and crop, just needs a boost on the brightness. :)</td>', 'something in your processing has created strange artifacts on the thin lines in the photo, like the red line details and the antenna. otherwise good angle and crop, just needs a boost on the brightness. :)', '2003-05-04 02:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(286879, 19667, 5007, '<td valign="top">Nice job of panning to keep the ambulance in sharp focus. The blurred background adds to the feeling of urgency. One thing that would make the shot even better would be to have the ambulance in the right hand part of the photo to also indicate speed.</td>', 'Nice job of panning to keep the ambulance in sharp focus. The blurred background adds to the feeling of urgency. One thing that would make the shot even better would be to have the ambulance in the right hand part of the photo to also indicate speed.', '2003-05-04 02:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(286881, 19630, 7711, '<td valign="top">the shadow ruins the shot..makes it so the grass is too bright and the top is shaded and dark and hasn''t really got any emotion to it.</td>', 'the shadow ruins the shot..makes it so the grass is too bright and the top is shaded and dark and hasn''t really got any emotion to it.', '2003-05-04 02:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(286882, 20008, 2978, '<td valign="top">I like the tone you create here. Just the bright signs are distracting.</td>', 'I like the tone you create here. Just the bright signs are distracting.', '2003-05-04 02:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(286883, 19890, 5007, '<td valign="top">Great job! I like how the train is blurred and the composition.</td>', 'Great job! I like how the train is blurred and the composition.', '2003-05-04 02:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(286884, 19828, 7711, '<td valign="top">nice abstract, would have cropped out the bit to the right that is out of focus so it doesn''t take up half the frame. :)</td>', 'nice abstract, would have cropped out the bit to the right that is out of focus so it doesn''t take up half the frame. :)', '2003-05-04 02:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(286885, 19699, 5007, '<td valign="top">The tone of this photo sets a mood that matches the setting very nicely. I also like the way you have the camera looking through into the next car.</td>', 'The tone of this photo sets a mood that matches the setting very nicely. I also like the way you have the camera looking through into the next car.', '2003-05-04 02:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(286886, 19421, 5007, '<td valign="top">Perfect name for this photo. Interesting job. It is nice to see the city "through" the train.</td>', 'Perfect name for this photo. Interesting job. It is nice to see the city "through" the train.', '2003-05-04 02:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(286887, 19798, 5007, '<td valign="top">My friend all drive Porsches.....</td>', 'My friend all drive Porsches.....', '2003-05-04 02:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(286888, 19975, 7711, '<td valign="top">your choice of backdrop with those neat buildings and the sepia really work for this trolley shot. I like your angle on the trolley too, nice shot. :)</td>', 'your choice of backdrop with those neat buildings and the sepia really work for this trolley shot. I like your angle on the trolley too, nice shot. :)', '2003-05-04 02:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(286889, 19852, 5007, '<td valign="top">I like the photo except that pole appears to cut the photo in half. I think I might have cropped it out.</td>', 'I like the photo except that pole appears to cut the photo in half. I think I might have cropped it out.', '2003-05-04 02:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(286890, 19953, 5007, '<td valign="top">I like how he seems to be just "dropping in".</td>', 'I like how he seems to be just "dropping in".', '2003-05-04 02:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(286891, 20052, 7711, '<td valign="top">not to be confused with "rental bikes" ;) I like the starkness of the sign, and not sure if you intended it, but i also really like hte view down the sidewalk, has a very urban pedestrian feel.</td>', 'not to be confused with "rental bikes" ;) I like the starkness of the sign, and not sure if you intended it, but i also really like hte view down the sidewalk, has a very urban pedestrian feel.', '2003-05-04 02:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(286892, 19733, 5007, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting... must have been at dusk.</td>', 'Nice lighting... must have been at dusk.', '2003-05-04 02:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(286893, 19814, 7711, '<td valign="top">move a bit more to your left so we can have more of the left track rail in the shot, and a little less pink in the sepia. :)</td>', 'move a bit more to your left so we can have more of the left track rail in the shot, and a little less pink in the sepia. :)', '2003-05-04 02:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(286894, 19299, 7711, '<td valign="top">great shot, but its a bit too grainy/noisy. Did you try some noise reduction software? I also would have liked to see that lovely blue colour more saturated.</td>', 'great shot, but its a bit too grainy/noisy. Did you try some noise reduction software? I also would have liked to see that lovely blue colour more saturated.', '2003-05-04 02:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(286895, 19969, 5007, '<td valign="top">There are several things I like about this photo, the bright contrasing colors, the composition and the bird landing in or taking off from the water.</td>', 'There are several things I like about this photo, the bright contrasing colors, the composition and the bird landing in or taking off from the water.', '2003-05-04 02:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(286896, 20021, 7711, '<td valign="top">i love how you''ve blown it out with the bright lights around the boots themselves. creates a great contrast with their darkness, and the wood that can be seen from the shadows and beyond the light is great too! very creative, I really like how you''ve set this shot up. well done!</td>', 'i love how you''ve blown it out with the bright lights around the boots themselves. creates a great contrast with their darkness, and the wood that can be seen from the shadows and beyond the light is great too! very creative, I really like how you''ve set this shot up. well done!', '2003-05-04 02:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(286897, 19983, 7350, '<td valign="top">Which, the bike wheels or the lady on the scooter?</td>', 'Which, the bike wheels or the lady on the scooter?', '2003-05-04 02:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(286898, 19983, 7711, '<td valign="top">oh goodness! my first bit of attention was at the lady on the motorized thing.. LOL I guess that means you might have missed keeping the attention on your main subject, despite the background being out of focus.  I am curious how this shot would have turned out if you did a very severe crop right above that little that is above the wheels.. might have worked out, or might just be me off on a flight of fancy! :)</td>', 'oh goodness! my first bit of attention was at the lady on the motorized thing.. LOL I guess that means you might have missed keeping the attention on your main subject, despite the background being out of focus.  I am curious how this shot would have turned out if you did a very severe crop right above that little that is above the wheels.. might have worked out, or might just be me off on a flight of fancy! :)', '2003-05-04 02:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(286899, 20044, 7350, '<td valign="top">I gotta know--is this a poster on your wall, or a computer screen, or something?</td>', 'I gotta know--is this a poster on your wall, or a computer screen, or something?', '2003-05-04 02:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(286900, 19969, 7350, '<td valign="top">Just a little too orange here.</td>', 'Just a little too orange here.', '2003-05-04 03:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(286901, 19992, 7711, '<td valign="top">what a great find! :) I wonder if the two riders of this "hell machine" are inside that church? LOL I would have preferred a little more saturation on that yellow valance, just because it contrasts nicely against the dark bricks, nice shot!</td>', 'what a great find! :) I wonder if the two riders of this "hell machine" are inside that church? LOL I would have preferred a little more saturation on that yellow valance, just because it contrasts nicely against the dark bricks, nice shot!', '2003-05-04 03:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(286902, 19660, 7711, '<td valign="top">i realize you were probably going for something wild, creative and abstact, but so much detail is lost with the way blown out whites that its really hard to tell how good of a digital photograph this is vs. your skills in post processing. Still a neat bit of work though. :)</td>', 'i realize you were probably going for something wild, creative and abstact, but so much detail is lost with the way blown out whites that its really hard to tell how good of a digital photograph this is vs. your skills in post processing. Still a neat bit of work though. :)', '2003-05-04 03:04:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(286903, 19489, 7350, '<td valign="top">I bet these feet haven''t transported anything even one step yet.  (just kidding - 7)</td>', 'I bet these feet haven''t transported anything even one step yet.  (just kidding - 7)', '2003-05-04 03:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(286907, 19969, 6172, '<td valign="top">That orange almost blinds me, otherwise seems perfect  to me.</td>', 'That orange almost blinds me, otherwise seems perfect  to me.', '2003-05-04 03:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(286909, 19740, 6172, '<td valign="top">I like the purple reflected in the chrome.</td>', 'I like the purple reflected in the chrome.', '2003-05-04 03:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(286931, 19777, 6019, '<td valign="top">good one, spoiled by the ''off'' horizon</td>', 'good one, spoiled by the ''off'' horizon', '2003-05-04 06:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(286941, 19637, 2978, '<td valign="top">I like the colours you put together here</td>', 'I like the colours you put together here', '2003-05-04 07:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(286942, 19956, 2978, '<td valign="top">Superb colours and motion capture. Composition tells story too.</td>', 'Superb colours and motion capture. Composition tells story too.', '2003-05-04 07:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(286945, 20028, 2978, '<td valign="top">The leading line works well with space. Good luck</td>', 'The leading line works well with space. Good luck', '2003-05-04 08:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(286947, 19299, 7510, '<td valign="top">Good Subject.  I loke Hot air ballons.  I think it would look so much better if the sun wasn''t behind the ballon.  With the light passing through it, the colours are washed out slightly.  I might have made the ballon smaller in this Photo and had more sky.</td>', 'Good Subject.  I loke Hot air ballons.  I think it would look so much better if the sun wasn''t behind the ballon.  With the light passing through it, the colours are washed out slightly.  I might have made the ballon smaller in this Photo and had more sky.', '2003-05-04 08:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(286948, 19575, 7510, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling I would rather have seen this Photo bigger, or maybe the bike at a different angle.  It doesn''t really stand out too much.  Also I think the background is too distracting.</td>', 'I get the feeling I would rather have seen this Photo bigger, or maybe the bike at a different angle.  It doesn''t really stand out too much.  Also I think the background is too distracting.', '2003-05-04 08:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(286950, 19634, 7510, '<td valign="top">Interesting Idea.  I might have cropped out more of the right so that the white line is removed, and added more to the left, but I get the feeling that there probably wasn''t anymore on the left side of the frame you could have added.</td>', 'Interesting Idea.  I might have cropped out more of the right so that the white line is removed, and added more to the left, but I get the feeling that there probably wasn''t anymore on the left side of the frame you could have added.', '2003-05-04 08:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(286952, 20055, 7510, '<td valign="top">This Photo loses my interest quickly.  Also, I think the boarder is too busy.</td>', 'This Photo loses my interest quickly.  Also, I think the boarder is too busy.', '2003-05-04 08:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(286955, 19462, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot.  It looks a little oversharpened.  I might have added a simple white boarder here.</td>', 'Nice Shot.  It looks a little oversharpened.  I might have added a simple white boarder here.', '2003-05-04 08:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(286957, 19686, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice car.  I like the angle.  Would be nicer without the shadows.</td>', 'Nice car.  I like the angle.  Would be nicer without the shadows.', '2003-05-04 08:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(286958, 19713, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like this rusted old car.  I think it''s cropped a little too tight though.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like this rusted old car.  I think it''s cropped a little too tight though.', '2003-05-04 08:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(286959, 19621, 7510, '<td valign="top">Interesting compostion.  Looks a little over edited for my taste.</td>', 'Interesting compostion.  Looks a little over edited for my taste.', '2003-05-04 08:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(286961, 19738, 3540, '<td valign="top">My kids are in the learning to ride bikes stage, so I know all about this.   I think the crop is a little to tight on this one. I''d at least have included the entire training wheel.</td>', 'My kids are in the learning to ride bikes stage, so I know all about this.   I think the crop is a little to tight on this one. I''d at least have included the entire training wheel.', '2003-05-04 08:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(286962, 19992, 7510, '<td valign="top">Is the focus of this Photo the Bike or the Church?  They seem separate entities in this photo.  Maybe if you shot it at a different angle, or found someother way to tie the two more together...  (6)</td>', 'Is the focus of this Photo the Bike or the Church?  They seem separate entities in this photo.  Maybe if you shot it at a different angle, or found someother way to tie the two more together...  (6)', '2003-05-04 08:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(286963, 19746, 3540, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of extra stuff in the background here.  The sky is a pretty funky color blue.  It looks like its pretty clear, but the sky is sort of a hazy grey.  I also think this photo could''ve used a little more exposure.</td>', 'There''s a lot of extra stuff in the background here.  The sky is a pretty funky color blue.  It looks like its pretty clear, but the sky is sort of a hazy grey.  I also think this photo could''ve used a little more exposure.', '2003-05-04 08:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(286964, 19910, 7510, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  The Red looks a little grainy.  I might have chosen a different angle or location so the roof of the building behind doesn''t look like it''s coming out of the van.</td>', 'Interesting.  The Red looks a little grainy.  I might have chosen a different angle or location so the roof of the building behind doesn''t look like it''s coming out of the van.', '2003-05-04 08:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(286966, 19914, 3540, '<td valign="top">The colors in the water are some very nice hues.  I really like this idea and actually I think the crop works pretty well for this picture.  I''m usually picky about cutting stuff off but I like this one cut off.  I never would''ve thought to do it this way.   Nice job</td>', 'The colors in the water are some very nice hues.  I really like this idea and actually I think the crop works pretty well for this picture.  I''m usually picky about cutting stuff off but I like this one cut off.  I never would''ve thought to do it this way.   Nice job', '2003-05-04 08:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(286967, 19999, 7510, '<td valign="top">Should you be taking pictures while driving down the highway?</td>', 'Should you be taking pictures while driving down the highway?', '2003-05-04 08:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(286968, 19585, 3540, '<td valign="top">The overall picture is just a little out of focus.  Conceptually its a good shot though.  I would''ve like to seen a little more room on the left side of the train.  The crop is just a little too tight.</td>', 'The overall picture is just a little out of focus.  Conceptually its a good shot though.  I would''ve like to seen a little more room on the left side of the train.  The crop is just a little too tight.', '2003-05-04 08:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(286969, 19898, 7510, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  I would have liked to see more toe here.  The location could probably have been more interesting.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  I would have liked to see more toe here.  The location could probably have been more interesting.', '2003-05-04 08:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(286970, 20036, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot</td>', 'Nice Shot', '2003-05-04 08:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(286971, 19455, 3540, '<td valign="top">There are 2 things I don''t like about this photo.  One is the color of the sky is pretty white.  The other is that the train is almost out of the frame.  I''d have liked to seen it on the left side of the frame traveling right.  I like the idea of this photo and the flowers give some nice colors as do the trees.</td>', 'There are 2 things I don''t like about this photo.  One is the color of the sky is pretty white.  The other is that the train is almost out of the frame.  I''d have liked to seen it on the left side of the frame traveling right.  I like the idea of this photo and the flowers give some nice colors as do the trees.', '2003-05-04 08:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(286972, 19887, 7510, '<td valign="top">Too dark...</td>', 'Too dark...', '2003-05-04 08:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(286973, 19494, 3540, '<td valign="top">What a crummy day.  You gotta shoot ''em when you can though I guess.  I like the portrayal of size, in terms of both aircrafts.  The small plane looks really small and it makes the big plane look really big.  That''s a nice contrast.</td>', 'What a crummy day.  You gotta shoot ''em when you can though I guess.  I like the portrayal of size, in terms of both aircrafts.  The small plane looks really small and it makes the big plane look really big.  That''s a nice contrast.', '2003-05-04 08:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(286974, 19901, 7510, '<td valign="top">Good Idea, but I would have liked to have seen more lines (cars) in this photo.  Maybe a longer esposure.</td>', 'Good Idea, but I would have liked to have seen more lines (cars) in this photo.  Maybe a longer esposure.', '2003-05-04 08:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(286975, 19683, 3540, '<td valign="top">I really like the rich color of the sky.  I don''t like how the prop is cut off at the top and bottom though.  I''d have liked to seen the whole thing.  I think if you did move back a few feet all the dead bug remains would be less visible.</td>', 'I really like the rich color of the sky.  I don''t like how the prop is cut off at the top and bottom though.  I''d have liked to seen the whole thing.  I think if you did move back a few feet all the dead bug remains would be less visible.', '2003-05-04 08:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(286976, 19946, 7510, '<td valign="top">Looks like there is a bit of camera shake.  Not a very good depiction of your idea.  Maybe if you choose a bigger parking lot.  Half the photo is of grass and houses.</td>', 'Looks like there is a bit of camera shake.  Not a very good depiction of your idea.  Maybe if you choose a bigger parking lot.  Half the photo is of grass and houses.', '2003-05-04 08:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(286978, 19877, 3540, '<td valign="top">The tonal quality to this pic has a lot of nice warm colors and a lot of appeal.  Nice job</td>', 'The tonal quality to this pic has a lot of nice warm colors and a lot of appeal.  Nice job', '2003-05-04 08:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(286979, 20028, 7510, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  I might have cropped more off the top, and added to the right.  I like the reduced colours and saturated double yellow.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  I might have cropped more off the top, and added to the right.  I like the reduced colours and saturated double yellow.', '2003-05-04 08:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(286980, 19602, 7510, '<td valign="top">Not a very interesting photo.  Very plain.</td>', 'Not a very interesting photo.  Very plain.', '2003-05-04 08:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(286981, 19593, 3540, '<td valign="top">This would''ve been a really good one to put into black and white.  There isn''t too much stuff in the background and none of it is all that new either so I think it would work really well as B&amp;W</td>', 'This would''ve been a really good one to put into black and white.  There isn''t too much stuff in the background and none of it is all that new either so I think it would work really well as B&W', '2003-05-04 08:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(286982, 19368, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice pic even with the choppy water.   Very nice sunset over the boat.</td>', 'This is a really nice pic even with the choppy water.   Very nice sunset over the boat.', '2003-05-04 09:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
