(288229, 20020, 4411, '<td valign="top">Well worth reshooting this on a clear day. A blue sky would make a great backdrop and the sun should bring out the yellow nicely. A great concept where the weather has let you down.</td>', 'Well worth reshooting this on a clear day. A blue sky would make a great backdrop and the sun should bring out the yellow nicely. A great concept where the weather has let you down.', '2003-05-05 17:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(288238, 19259, 4411, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why you''ve chosen to desaturate, it doesn''t add anything to the shot that having the whites, greys &amp; browns of the track would give IMO. Sepia may have worked, but I would prefer to see it in normal colours.<br/>Composition is good and I like the idea though.</td>', 'I don''t understand why you''ve chosen to desaturate, it doesn''t add anything to the shot that having the whites, greys & browns of the track would give IMO. Sepia may have worked, but I would prefer to see it in normal colours.Composition is good and I like the idea though.', '2003-05-05 17:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
