(288251, 19885, 6202, '<td valign="top">What a cool old engine.  Part of the front seems to be in a very sharp focus and part of it seems to be somewhat soft.  Not sure if it is just lighting making it appear that way or if you focused on the engines number and ended up with the entire engine being slightly soft.  I like soft focus though and the only thing that might make thei better would have been doing a sepia tone to give it the aged look to help hide the softness.</td>', 'What a cool old engine.  Part of the front seems to be in a very sharp focus and part of it seems to be somewhat soft.  Not sure if it is just lighting making it appear that way or if you focused on the engines number and ended up with the entire engine being slightly soft.  I like soft focus though and the only thing that might make thei better would have been doing a sepia tone to give it the aged look to help hide the softness.', '2003-05-05 17:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
