(288721, 19992, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like this photo very very much and gave it a high mark. This is a great "catch." There''s definitely an interesting story here and I feel I would like to get to know more about the pastors and about this chruch and where they are taking the parishoners. The bright lighting outside works with the darkness inside of the church to give it an eerie feel... also makes the lettering stand out on the sign above, which is very important. Photographically, I have a couple of nitpicks...first, I think the photo should have been rotated about 2 degrees left and secondly,  the glare in the left most door. Maybe a polarizing filter could have taken care of that This is the first photo I''ve found on DPC since I"ve joined to really get me excited !. Should be in Life Mag</td>', 'I like this photo very very much and gave it a high mark. This is a great "catch." There''s definitely an interesting story here and I feel I would like to get to know more about the pastors and about this chruch and where they are taking the parishoners. The bright lighting outside works with the darkness inside of the church to give it an eerie feel... also makes the lettering stand out on the sign above, which is very important. Photographically, I have a couple of nitpicks...first, I think the photo should have been rotated about 2 degrees left and secondly,  the glare in the left most door. Maybe a polarizing filter could have taken care of that This is the first photo I''ve found on DPC since I"ve joined to really get me excited !. Should be in Life Mag', '2003-05-06 03:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(288742, 20039, 6458, '<td valign="top">a v16? How odd. What kind of car is this?  Ohh I see now. Very very clever.  I love the colors but I think the composition is a bit cluttered. Not sure how you could have made it better tho... 8</td>', 'a v16? How odd. What kind of car is this?  Ohh I see now. Very very clever.  I love the colors but I think the composition is a bit cluttered. Not sure how you could have made it better tho... 8', '2003-05-06 05:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(288747, 19686, 3540, '<td valign="top">THis looks like a shot from HOT ROD magazine minus a little professional touchup.  The subject against the trees provides a nice contrast.  If it were a little less shadowy it would be a little better.   Nice car and nice pic</td>', 'THis looks like a shot from HOT ROD magazine minus a little professional touchup.  The subject against the trees provides a nice contrast.  If it were a little less shadowy it would be a little better.   Nice car and nice pic', '2003-05-06 05:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(288749, 19885, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good perspective shot.  I don''t like how close the crop is on top.  The other train in the background would be better if it were gone, but its not too major of a distraction.  This engine though is a good find.  Nice pic</td>', 'Good perspective shot.  I don''t like how close the crop is on top.  The other train in the background would be better if it were gone, but its not too major of a distraction.  This engine though is a good find.  Nice pic', '2003-05-06 05:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(288752, 19974, 3540, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate the hilliness of SF with this pic.  But honestly I don''t like the angle of this shot or leveling the shot to the trolley.  I''d have like to seen this a little more from the front or back of the trolley, more like a 3/4 shot instead of a full side view.</td>', 'I can appreciate the hilliness of SF with this pic.  But honestly I don''t like the angle of this shot or leveling the shot to the trolley.  I''d have like to seen this a little more from the front or back of the trolley, more like a 3/4 shot instead of a full side view.', '2003-05-06 05:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(288755, 19667, 3540, '<td valign="top">Awesome panning shot.  I''ve been trying to do this my whole life I think.  Anything faster than my kid and I can''t get it halfway focused.   Awesome freeze motion shot.  Very very well done! - 9</td>', 'Awesome panning shot.  I''ve been trying to do this my whole life I think.  Anything faster than my kid and I can''t get it halfway focused.   Awesome freeze motion shot.  Very very well done! - 9', '2003-05-06 05:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(288757, 20008, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good concept and well executed.  The one thing that really brings this down is the white part under the sign closest the camera.  The ones in the background aren''t quite so big nor bright.  The one in front though is more than a little distracting.  The red light is very cool looking the way that was captured.</td>', 'Good concept and well executed.  The one thing that really brings this down is the white part under the sign closest the camera.  The ones in the background aren''t quite so big nor bright.  The one in front though is more than a little distracting.  The red light is very cool looking the way that was captured.', '2003-05-06 05:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(288760, 20056, 3540, '<td valign="top">This would be a  more successful shot if you could''ve been closer to the subject and used a shallow DOF to get the rider focused and blurred the background.  The whole thing blurred doesn''t really do it for me.  The title is great though.  We have guys like this driving around our little redneck town all the time.</td>', 'This would be a  more successful shot if you could''ve been closer to the subject and used a shallow DOF to get the rider focused and blurred the background.  The whole thing blurred doesn''t really do it for me.  The title is great though.  We have guys like this driving around our little redneck town all the time.', '2003-05-06 05:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(288762, 20023, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset.  Good concept of the shot.  I''d have used the bike to frame the shot more than this.  This is not really framing so much as blocking.  I hope you got some nice shots of the sunset without the bike in it too.  Its gorgeous.</td>', 'Nice sunset.  Good concept of the shot.  I''d have used the bike to frame the shot more than this.  This is not really framing so much as blocking.  I hope you got some nice shots of the sunset without the bike in it too.  Its gorgeous.', '2003-05-06 05:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(288767, 19796, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.  I really love the way the 3 ducklings are perfectly lined up.  This is really a very sweet picture, although I''m not totally sold on this pic for this challenge, but what the heck?  I''ll give you an 8 anyway -Bob</td>', 'Excellent capture.  I really love the way the 3 ducklings are perfectly lined up.  This is really a very sweet picture, although I''m not totally sold on this pic for this challenge, but what the heck?  I''ll give you an 8 anyway -Bob', '2003-05-06 05:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(288768, 19502, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the size or the aspect ratio of this pic.  I do however love the subject and the background.  I''d have cropped the top of this off and made it a full size pic.  Maybe even got rid of the white border too.  This is a great capture and a nice pic to boot.</td>', 'I don''t like the size or the aspect ratio of this pic.  I do however love the subject and the background.  I''d have cropped the top of this off and made it a full size pic.  Maybe even got rid of the white border too.  This is a great capture and a nice pic to boot.', '2003-05-06 06:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(288770, 19851, 3540, '<td valign="top">What an AWESOME building.  The train is pretty good too, but the building has me hooked on this one.  Nice clear building and good contrast to the moving train also.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'What an AWESOME building.  The train is pretty good too, but the building has me hooked on this one.  Nice clear building and good contrast to the moving train also.  Very nice shot.', '2003-05-06 06:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(288774, 19891, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of this one.  Looks like a new-fangled suit commercial.  This guy for some reason reminds me of a pilot.  Anyway, it''s just a little underexposed for my tastes.  I think that its pretty good overall though</td>', 'I like the angle of this one.  Looks like a new-fangled suit commercial.  This guy for some reason reminds me of a pilot.  Anyway, it''s just a little underexposed for my tastes.  I think that its pretty good overall though', '2003-05-06 06:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(288778, 19646, 3540, '<td valign="top">hate the border.  The part inside it is pretty good though.  II''ve always liked these shots.</td>', 'hate the border.  The part inside it is pretty good though.  II''ve always liked these shots.', '2003-05-06 06:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(288782, 20035, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good use of selective focus and of using the blurry thing to help frame the shot.  I wouldn''t mind seeing that once in my life when I''m behind the wheel :)</td>', 'Good use of selective focus and of using the blurry thing to help frame the shot.  I wouldn''t mind seeing that once in my life when I''m behind the wheel :)', '2003-05-06 06:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(288785, 19984, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the old look to this photo.  It has more of a digital art feel than a photograph, but its very good like this in these settings with this subject.  Nice work</td>', 'I like the old look to this photo.  It has more of a digital art feel than a photograph, but its very good like this in these settings with this subject.  Nice work', '2003-05-06 06:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(288787, 19338, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very very underexposed.  I think with the right exposure this would be pretty good.  If the sun were really bright I can see the reason why it would be, but most of the way covered up, it just looks dark more than anything.  It would''ve been really cool with the sun real bright in the background with the boat silhouette.</td>', 'Very very underexposed.  I think with the right exposure this would be pretty good.  If the sun were really bright I can see the reason why it would be, but most of the way covered up, it just looks dark more than anything.  It would''ve been really cool with the sun real bright in the background with the boat silhouette.', '2003-05-06 06:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(288790, 19998, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space on this photo.  leading lines too with the leg going to the foot.  Nice simple pic with a basic black background... I like it</td>', 'Good use of negative space on this photo.  leading lines too with the leg going to the foot.  Nice simple pic with a basic black background... I like it', '2003-05-06 06:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(288792, 19359, 3540, '<td valign="top">If the rest of this pic could''ve been clearer, besides the bus, it would''ve done better in my book.  If this is handheld, a tripod would''ve added at least one point to your score and probably 2.</td>', 'If the rest of this pic could''ve been clearer, besides the bus, it would''ve done better in my book.  If this is handheld, a tripod would''ve added at least one point to your score and probably 2.', '2003-05-06 06:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(288794, 19991, 3540, '<td valign="top">awesome.  Love the blue theme going on in here.  Its like the movie TRON.  Looks like a great place to take pics.  You did a great job with this one</td>', 'awesome.  Love the blue theme going on in here.  Its like the movie TRON.  Looks like a great place to take pics.  You did a great job with this one', '2003-05-06 06:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(288795, 19773, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great ship.  THe backdrop is sweet.  This is a very nice capture of a very cool ship.  I wish it were focused just a little more though.</td>', 'Great ship.  THe backdrop is sweet.  This is a very nice capture of a very cool ship.  I wish it were focused just a little more though.', '2003-05-06 06:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(288798, 19606, 3540, '<td valign="top">If this were just a tad clearer it would''ve done much better.  Good subjects and background.</td>', 'If this were just a tad clearer it would''ve done much better.  Good subjects and background.', '2003-05-06 06:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(288800, 19676, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail.  Really nice clear sharp pic.  Very well done - 10</td>', 'Excellent detail.  Really nice clear sharp pic.  Very well done - 10', '2003-05-06 06:29:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(288801, 20045, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great photo of the traffic with an awesome backdrop - 10</td>', 'Great photo of the traffic with an awesome backdrop - 10', '2003-05-06 06:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(288841, 19586, 8461, '<td valign="top">This is way off subject, I''m afraid. In the title it says "ride", but in the picture there''s no ride, at best there''s a destination reached a long time ago.</td>', 'This is way off subject, I''m afraid. In the title it says "ride", but in the picture there''s no ride, at best there''s a destination reached a long time ago.', '2003-05-06 07:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(288843, 19796, 8461, '<td valign="top">It''s a good photo, but I rated it rather low because I think it doesn''t fit the subject. Transportation either requires a vehicle, or some track, or both. Even if the ducks had been swimming, it wouldn''t be transportation. This is why we don''t see moving flocks, herds, shoals, etc. in this contest.</td>', 'It''s a good photo, but I rated it rather low because I think it doesn''t fit the subject. Transportation either requires a vehicle, or some track, or both. Even if the ducks had been swimming, it wouldn''t be transportation. This is why we don''t see moving flocks, herds, shoals, etc. in this contest.', '2003-05-06 08:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(288873, 19601, 3028, '<td valign="top">Crysp and beautiful image with the border strengthening the blacks of the train. Would have liked to see some blue skies here though, a white sky always looks strange. Good job - 7</td>', 'Crysp and beautiful image with the border strengthening the blacks of the train. Would have liked to see some blue skies here though, a white sky always looks strange. Good job - 7', '2003-05-06 09:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(288876, 19914, 3028, '<td valign="top">I like it! The orange-ish tones of the water make it come alive and the boat being stripped down to a sceleton gives you a sense of history here. Good job - 7</td>', 'I like it! The orange-ish tones of the water make it come alive and the boat being stripped down to a sceleton gives you a sense of history here. Good job - 7', '2003-05-06 09:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(288877, 20056, 3028, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy and over-saturated but what a great capture! Good job. - 7</td>', 'A bit grainy and over-saturated but what a great capture! Good job. - 7', '2003-05-06 09:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(288880, 19843, 3028, '<td valign="top">Beautiful trees contrasting with the car-wreck. Nice one although I preferred the photos that were showing movement... that''s just me! - 7</td>', 'Beautiful trees contrasting with the car-wreck. Nice one although I preferred the photos that were showing movement... that''s just me! - 7', '2003-05-06 09:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(288882, 19621, 3028, '<td valign="top">This is too grainy, too strange and too white. Keep working on your technique! - 1</td>', 'This is too grainy, too strange and too white. Keep working on your technique! - 1', '2003-05-06 09:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(288883, 19808, 3028, '<td valign="top">I''m really bothered by the fact that the photographer (obviously intentionally) is almost like the main subject of this photograph. Also the picture is over-sharpened, the smooth curves of the logo are not antialiased. Also try not to place your subject in the center of the frame. - 1</td>', 'I''m really bothered by the fact that the photographer (obviously intentionally) is almost like the main subject of this photograph. Also the picture is over-sharpened, the smooth curves of the logo are not antialiased. Also try not to place your subject in the center of the frame. - 1', '2003-05-06 09:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(288885, 19961, 3028, '<td valign="top">I actually fail to see the transportation relevance here. Maybe it''s the stream that once was a road to ships. Is this a canal? Had there been a boat perhaps... - 1</td>', 'I actually fail to see the transportation relevance here. Maybe it''s the stream that once was a road to ships. Is this a canal? Had there been a boat perhaps... - 1', '2003-05-06 09:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(288887, 19430, 3028, '<td valign="top">This is a snapshot with no enthusiasm for artistic values. I just overall find it ugly and not at all pleasing to the eye! - 1</td>', 'This is a snapshot with no enthusiasm for artistic values. I just overall find it ugly and not at all pleasing to the eye! - 1', '2003-05-06 09:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(288888, 19703, 3028, '<td valign="top">Now there''s a stretch!!! - 1</td>', 'Now there''s a stretch!!! - 1', '2003-05-06 09:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(288889, 19812, 3028, '<td valign="top">A lot of feet, which really doesn''t do the subject matter justice in my opinion. Also the colors are really strange and the heavy-contrast doesn''t help either. - 2</td>', 'A lot of feet, which really doesn''t do the subject matter justice in my opinion. Also the colors are really strange and the heavy-contrast doesn''t help either. - 2', '2003-05-06 09:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
