(288892, 19565, 3028, '<td valign="top">Just a basic shot that doesn''t seem to grab my attention. Maybe a larger shot with some outlines would have been better...? - 2</td>', 'Just a basic shot that doesn''t seem to grab my attention. Maybe a larger shot with some outlines would have been better...? - 2', '2003-05-06 09:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
