(289342, 19907, 6451, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Nice clarity.   I like how the object is placed over the numbers to add interest.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice image.  Nice clarity.   I like how the object is placed over the numbers to add interest.  Good job.', '2003-05-06 14:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
