(289592, 19953, 4411, '<td valign="top">Beaten by the other ''nutter with a propeller strapped to his back'' photo for me, but this is still great. Good sharp focus, great composition against a perfect blue sky and a zoom lens to die for!</td>', 'Beaten by the other ''nutter with a propeller strapped to his back'' photo for me, but this is still great. Good sharp focus, great composition against a perfect blue sky and a zoom lens to die for!', '2003-05-06 20:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
