(289819, 19740, 2389, '<td valign="top">This is a 100 Year Anniversary Harley on display for a raffle during a Mariner baseball game in Seattle. It is under a purple awning that the sun was shining on. If you look carefully at the center chrome engine cover, you can see the corner of the awning. The whole area had a purple "glow". All I did to the photo was crop and click the "auto-levels" button in ACDSee. <br/></td>', 'This is a 100 Year Anniversary Harley on display for a raffle during a Mariner baseball game in Seattle. It is under a purple awning that the sun was shining on. If you look carefully at the center chrome engine cover, you can see the corner of the awning. The whole area had a purple "glow". All I did to the photo was crop and click the "auto-levels" button in ACDSee. ', '2003-05-07 01:22:11.000000', NULL, 0),
