(289859, 19862, 7416, '<td valign="top">This was taken at a Car Show and the crowd limited the opportunities to<br/>get a good shot. The cloudy day also made an impact on the way the <br/>reflections and highlights worked on the truck.<br/>This is a very meticously restored pickup and I felt that to take less than a full shot would not do the truck justice<br/> <br/>Theron</td>', 'This was taken at a Car Show and the crowd limited the opportunities toget a good shot. The cloudy day also made an impact on the way the reflections and highlights worked on the truck.This is a very meticously restored pickup and I felt that to take less than a full shot would not do the truck justice Theron', '2003-05-07 01:33:08.000000', NULL, 0),
