(289871, 19984, 3607, '<td valign="top">i''m very surprised that this photo scored only at 5.0 (i rated it a 7 and think it should have done better than my submission).  to some, the washed out look might have been too . . . non-perfect photo (blech!), but as i look at it again (and i don''t know the layout) perhaps if the cropping hadn''t been so tight (assuming beyond the border would be interesting) that might be another suggestion.  whatever, its better than your score and keep on doing what you''re doing.  cheers, tom</td>', 'i''m very surprised that this photo scored only at 5.0 (i rated it a 7 and think it should have done better than my submission).  to some, the washed out look might have been too . . . non-perfect photo (blech!), but as i look at it again (and i don''t know the layout) perhaps if the cropping hadn''t been so tight (assuming beyond the border would be interesting) that might be another suggestion.  whatever, its better than your score and keep on doing what you''re doing.  cheers, tom', '2003-05-07 01:38:21.000000', NULL, 0),
