(289898, 19995, 7222, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot to everyone!<br/>Your comments are very helpful, it is very nice to hear what you like/dislike/noticed in this picture.<br/>Thanks again! :)</td>', 'Thanks a lot to everyone!Your comments are very helpful, it is very nice to hear what you like/dislike/noticed in this picture.Thanks again! :)', '2003-05-07 01:49:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(289905, 19771, 843, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments. I knew this would not do well here, but I liked it. I only wish people would take it for granted that the photog knew what they were doing. I know people have the best intentions when they comment that it is blurry, but it was intentional. Thanks for listening.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments. I knew this would not do well here, but I liked it. I only wish people would take it for granted that the photog knew what they were doing. I know people have the best intentions when they comment that it is blurry, but it was intentional. Thanks for listening.', '2003-05-07 01:54:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(289928, 19991, 6521, '<td valign="top">Good to see my favorite win...Congrats!!</td>', 'Good to see my favorite win...Congrats!!', '2003-05-07 02:04:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(290009, 19637, 6458, '<td valign="top">It was interesting seeing the reaction to the colours in this photo. I wonder how many people thought they were done in post-processing and gave me a lower score because of it?<br/> <br/>Would the picture have scored higher if they knew <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=20857" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> is what the original looked like? Not much difference. The blue and magenta have been brought out more, but that''s it.</td>', 'It was interesting seeing the reaction to the colours in this photo. I wonder how many people thought they were done in post-processing and gave me a lower score because of it? Would the picture have scored higher if they knew this is what the original looked like? Not much difference. The blue and magenta have been brought out more, but that''s it.', '2003-05-07 02:30:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(290032, 19991, 5728, '<td valign="top">Mag excellent! You are armed and dangerous. Whatever you''ve been on the last few weeks I want some too!!!!!</td>', 'Mag excellent! You are armed and dangerous. Whatever you''ve been on the last few weeks I want some too!!!!!', '2003-05-07 02:40:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(290034, 19991, 255, '<td valign="top">just beautiful mag! you are taking over dpc! :)<br/></td>', 'just beautiful mag! you are taking over dpc! :)', '2003-05-07 02:42:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(290039, 19487, 6565, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, folks!  I had one that I''d cropped in MUCH closer, and it was a lot brighter that way, but I thought the way the helicopter stood out with the mist was somehow more interesting.  Also, when it was cropped closer, it was just a helicopter and not a dramatic crop-duster flying over a neighborhood and waking everyone up.<br/> <br/>I must agree with y''all, though, that it doesn''t work very well as a photograph in a general sense.  Ah, next week, perhaps! :)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments, folks!  I had one that I''d cropped in MUCH closer, and it was a lot brighter that way, but I thought the way the helicopter stood out with the mist was somehow more interesting.  Also, when it was cropped closer, it was just a helicopter and not a dramatic crop-duster flying over a neighborhood and waking everyone up. I must agree with y''all, though, that it doesn''t work very well as a photograph in a general sense.  Ah, next week, perhaps! :)', '2003-05-07 02:44:54.000000', NULL, 0),
