(290156, 19991, 3540, '<td valign="top">Someone is hogging all the ribbons....<br/> <br/>Originally, I almost "accused" you of being xertion with the style of this pic and also the quality of it.  This has the cool blue Tron hue.  Oh yea, and its a very nice pic.  One of my 2 10''s this week.  Congrats Kollin on another ribbon :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by magnetic9999 - edit.</i></td>', 'Someone is hogging all the ribbons.... Originally, I almost "accused" you of being xertion with the style of this pic and also the quality of it.  This has the cool blue Tron hue.  Oh yea, and its a very nice pic.  One of my 2 10''s this week.  Congrats Kollin on another ribbon :)Message edited by magnetic9999 - edit.', '2003-05-07 06:00:31.000000', NULL, 0),
