(290262, 19635, 7369, '<td valign="top">My aim was to show movement in the train but at the same time show some of the train itself. Unfortunately the result is somewhat of a mixed bag. The train travelled at around 120 km/h so I think I should have used a longer exposure time and to counter overexposure perhaps ISO50 setting.<br/>What I like about the photo is the contrast between the white bridge and the colorful train. Next time better luck I guess :).</td>', 'My aim was to show movement in the train but at the same time show some of the train itself. Unfortunately the result is somewhat of a mixed bag. The train travelled at around 120 km/h so I think I should have used a longer exposure time and to counter overexposure perhaps ISO50 setting.What I like about the photo is the contrast between the white bridge and the colorful train. Next time better luck I guess :).', '2003-05-07 08:53:10.000000', NULL, 0),
