(290739, 19808, 7358, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pesinn:</b></div><hr/><i>I''m really bothered by the fact that the photographer (obviously intentionally) is almost like the main subject of this photograph. Also the picture is over-sharpened, the smooth curves of the logo are not antialiased. Also try not to place your subject in the center of the frame. - 1</i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Originally posted by pesinn:I''m really bothered by the fact that the photographer (obviously intentionally) is almost like the main subject of this photograph. Also the picture is over-sharpened, the smooth curves of the logo are not antialiased. Also try not to place your subject in the center of the frame. - 1', '2003-05-07 13:42:33.000000', NULL, 0),
