(290883, 19937, 7857, '<td valign="top">I just wanted to send out a quick thank you to all the people who commented on this picture (and of course all who voted) in case any of you come back to look at it again.<br/> <br/>So this is the tramway in Saltburn (on the North East coast of the UK, near Middlesbrough - for anyone outside the UK who is interested), I came back to shoot it 3 times trying to get the framing just right. I auto adjusted the levels and cropped it slightly to get out a bit of scaffold but it''s basically as shot.<br/> <br/>Again, I just want to say thanks for the great comments and I hope I can do as well in the future.<br/> <br/>Mitford</td>', 'I just wanted to send out a quick thank you to all the people who commented on this picture (and of course all who voted) in case any of you come back to look at it again. So this is the tramway in Saltburn (on the North East coast of the UK, near Middlesbrough - for anyone outside the UK who is interested), I came back to shoot it 3 times trying to get the framing just right. I auto adjusted the levels and cropped it slightly to get out a bit of scaffold but it''s basically as shot. Again, I just want to say thanks for the great comments and I hope I can do as well in the future. Mitford', '2003-05-07 14:54:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(290909, 20061, 7131, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pncowley:</b></div><hr/><i>Hey, Utah! That''s where I am too. Jeremy, is that you? I like the color and composition of this photo. Nice job.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks, but no, my name is Boyd.  I have a good friend named Jeremy though. :)  Did you hear about the SUV-Trax collision just the other day?  I was supposed to be on that train but missed it by a few seconds.  Weird.</td>', 'Originally posted by pncowley:Hey, Utah! That''s where I am too. Jeremy, is that you? I like the color and composition of this photo. Nice job.  Thanks, but no, my name is Boyd.  I have a good friend named Jeremy though. :)  Did you hear about the SUV-Trax collision just the other day?  I was supposed to be on that train but missed it by a few seconds.  Weird.', '2003-05-07 15:08:06.000000', NULL, 0),
