(291575, 20056, 6261, '<td valign="top">I was driving down the road and passed this guy.  I slammed on the brakes jumped out, grabbed my camera and had time to only take two shots.  I didn''t think it would do well, just thought it would be good for a laugh!</td>', 'I was driving down the road and passed this guy.  I slammed on the brakes jumped out, grabbed my camera and had time to only take two shots.  I didn''t think it would do well, just thought it would be good for a laugh!', '2003-05-08 00:15:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(291738, 20031, 7690, '<td valign="top">aarghh, I am sure that the reflection in the window was intentional, folks. <br/>I like it and think the reflection of the man with the baseball cap is sort of a comparison in opposites...old car/the past - man''s head inside car like a ghost but has a baseball cap/the present...past and present. White background adds to the otherworldliness...almost like going into the "white light". <br/>This is great!</td>', 'aarghh, I am sure that the reflection in the window was intentional, folks. I like it and think the reflection of the man with the baseball cap is sort of a comparison in opposites...old car/the past - man''s head inside car like a ghost but has a baseball cap/the present...past and present. White background adds to the otherworldliness...almost like going into the "white light". This is great!', '2003-05-08 04:17:49.000000', NULL, 0),
