(533438, 19863, 13759, '<td valign="top">Wonderful subject. The most interesting thing in photographs are that we need the contact with it. This makes the pleasure of view it´s photos, specially when we get a surpassing subject.<br/>On the next time, in the same situation, try to set the DOF to a shallow DOF. This will improve the principal subject!</td>', 'Wonderful subject. The most interesting thing in photographs are that we need the contact with it. This makes the pleasure of view it´s photos, specially when we get a surpassing subject.On the next time, in the same situation, try to set the DOF to a shallow DOF. This will improve the principal subject!', '2004-01-06 12:52:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(683974, 19601, 772, '<td valign="top">This thing is massive :)  Did you work any closeups?  Excellent work...</td>', 'This thing is massive :)  Did you work any closeups?  Excellent work...', '2004-04-24 22:40:33.000000', NULL, 0),
